WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Downloaded from CINEFREAK.NET

00:02:28.291 --> 00:02:30.291
Bringing her to this room was a mistake.

00:02:33.666 --> 00:02:34.541
What happened?

00:02:34.875 --> 00:02:36.625
There… Upstairs, in that room!

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.791
All you women, leave at once!

00:02:43.875 --> 00:02:45.291
We need to leave this place.
Right now!

00:04:25.458 --> 00:04:26.333
Kavya!

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:47.791
{\an8}<i>It's your first time out on your own.
Be careful, and do as I say.</i>

00:04:48.291 --> 00:04:50.875
<i>Don't eat junk.
Take care of your health.</i>

00:04:51.083 --> 00:04:52.750
<i>Call home every evening.</i>

00:04:53.166 --> 00:04:55.916
<i>It's the middle of the pandemic.
Wear your mask wherever you go.</i>

00:04:56.375 --> 00:04:58.791
{\an8}<i>It's a new place.
Get along well with your roommates.</i>

00:04:59.125 --> 00:05:01.250
{\an8}<i>Don't pick fights with anyone.
Understood?</i>

00:05:02.333 --> 00:05:05.875
<i>This laziness won't get you anywhere.
Start waking up early in the morning.</i>

00:05:06.458 --> 00:05:10.625
<i>Start smoking and drinking too, okay?</i>

00:05:13.583 --> 00:05:15.416
He's not listening
to a word you're saying.

00:05:15.833 --> 00:05:17.625
{\an8}- I'm listening, Dad!
- Study hard.

00:05:17.875 --> 00:05:21.374
{\an8}We have a lot of hope riding on you,
your grandma was saying the other day.

00:05:21.375 --> 00:05:25.166
"Once Vivek becomes a doctor,
we'll get our check-ups done for free."

00:05:25.291 --> 00:05:26.625
Will your mother be around till then?

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:29.500
- Hey, Vivek?
- Yes, Dad.

00:05:30.625 --> 00:05:34.041
- Keep this for your expenses.
- Do you think money grows on trees?

00:05:34.166 --> 00:05:36.541
He's just a kid.
Why does he need so much money?

00:05:37.666 --> 00:05:38.625
This is enough.

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:41.125
Oh, Mom. This is too much.

00:05:59.458 --> 00:06:01.000
Couldn't you find any other bus to jump
in front of and die?

00:06:01.166 --> 00:06:02.250
Where are you going?

00:06:04.458 --> 00:06:06.000
Vedagiri. This is enough, right?

00:06:06.791 --> 00:06:09.082
At this fare, I'll drop you straight home.

00:06:09.083 --> 00:06:12.207
They say rubbing lemon on your nose
once in a while keeps Corona away.

00:06:12.208 --> 00:06:15.041
- You do the same.
- That's not how it works, Auntie.

00:06:16.833 --> 00:06:18.791
First, lick some salt,

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:20.749
take a sip of liquor,

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:22.291
then squeeze lemon into your mouth.

00:06:22.458 --> 00:06:24.041
- Maximum results.
- Yeah?

00:06:24.458 --> 00:06:26.750
- Heard that? You should follow that too.
- Okay.

00:06:27.541 --> 00:06:29.333
Are you from VIMS too?

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:31.791
Vedagiri Medical College.

00:06:32.125 --> 00:06:33.957
No, Auntie. I study law in London.

00:06:33.958 --> 00:06:34.833
Oh!

00:06:35.291 --> 00:06:37.041
This is my only son, Vivek.

00:06:37.666 --> 00:06:40.166
- Hi, Vivek. I'm Saisha.
- Hi.

00:06:40.291 --> 00:06:44.041
Actually, in family, he is
the number one doctor ever.

00:06:44.666 --> 00:06:47.291
She's trying to say that he'll be
the first doctor in our family.

00:06:47.666 --> 00:06:48.915
What about brother Suri?

00:06:48.916 --> 00:06:51.666
Doctor, my foot! He's just a dentist.

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:55.290
You seem like a bright girl.

00:06:55.291 --> 00:06:56.958
Why don't you want to be a doctor?

00:06:57.333 --> 00:06:58.583
- Mom…
- Wait a minute.

00:07:00.375 --> 00:07:01.375
Let me ask.

00:07:01.625 --> 00:07:03.750
Doctors are in great demand these days.

00:07:05.666 --> 00:07:07.708
I could argue with
you about that, Auntie…

00:07:12.041 --> 00:07:13.291
but I don't argue for free.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.166
- Stay away from people like her.
- Vedagiri College Cross Road!

00:07:18.875 --> 00:07:20.166
Next stop is ours.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.207
{\an8}Once you finish your studies,

00:07:28.208 --> 00:07:30.083
{\an8}we'll open a clinic
for you right next to our shop.

00:07:30.708 --> 00:07:32.458
{\an8}Then we can pay off all our debts.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:34.416
- Debts?
- Yes.

00:07:34.625 --> 00:07:38.000
How do you think we managed
the donation for such a big college?

00:07:38.916 --> 00:07:40.791
The moment you said
you wanted to study here,

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:43.791
your father mortgaged everything
we had to make it happen.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:47.250
Don't study just to build your own future.

00:07:48.291 --> 00:07:50.333
Study, so that all of us
can have a better life.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:52.208
Do you understand?

00:07:52.791 --> 00:07:54.541
{\an8}Isn't it still another nine
or ten kilometers from here?

00:07:54.666 --> 00:07:56.041
{\an8}This bus doesn't go there, sir.

00:07:56.291 --> 00:07:58.916
{\an8}- Doesn't your bus go through there?
- Nobody goes there.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.957
{\an8}We take the longer route instead.

00:08:00.958 --> 00:08:02.666
{\an8}Please… I've got a lot of luggage.

00:08:02.791 --> 00:08:04.000
{\an8}Just a little further.

00:08:09.083 --> 00:08:10.333
{\an8}It's not about the money, sir.

00:08:10.916 --> 00:08:13.250
{\an8}None of them will come even if we do.

00:08:17.125 --> 00:08:18.624
{\an8}Why won't that bus go all the way there?

00:08:18.625 --> 00:08:20.290
{\an8}How are we supposed to get there
from this far away?

00:08:20.291 --> 00:08:22.415
The college should've told us beforehand.

00:08:22.416 --> 00:08:24.540
The conductor said even
the locals won't go there?

00:08:24.541 --> 00:08:25.582
What kind of college is this?

00:08:25.583 --> 00:08:27.416
How are we supposed
to send our kid there now?

00:08:27.583 --> 00:08:29.375
{\an8}What kind of place has he joined?

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:31.708
{\an8}Are the locals and the college at odds?

00:08:34.833 --> 00:08:37.165
- We'll burn that building down!
- We won't let this happen!

00:08:37.166 --> 00:08:39.749
{\an8}It's a boys' hostel now.
No women are allowed inside.

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:41.416
You don't know what happened there!

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.125
I know.

00:08:44.375 --> 00:08:46.791
My uncle closed it because
of some made-up stories.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.625
Now that he's gone,
we're reopening the building.

00:08:49.958 --> 00:08:52.958
"Sealed for 15 years…
Abandoned VIMS building reopened."

00:08:53.166 --> 00:08:54.124
That's not all, sir.

00:08:54.125 --> 00:08:55.166
Five other newspapers
have carried the same story.

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:58.082
I'm beginning to think reopening
that building was a mistake.

00:08:58.083 --> 00:09:00.875
- At least the fourth floor…
- Do you even hear yourself?

00:09:01.291 --> 00:09:03.333
We had our highest admissions this year.

00:09:03.708 --> 00:09:06.625
You want us to shut down
an entire floor? Waste seventeen rooms?

00:09:06.833 --> 00:09:08.375
Where would the students go, sir?

00:09:08.916 --> 00:09:11.083
Firstly, the locals
won't even take them in.

00:09:11.208 --> 00:09:12.583
No one will rent them a room.

00:09:13.333 --> 00:09:14.833
You've locked that room, haven't you?

00:09:15.333 --> 00:09:16.875
That should be enough
to put those rumors to rest.

00:09:17.208 --> 00:09:19.458
Locking the room might
silence people, sir…

00:09:19.666 --> 00:09:21.416
but it won't stop what's inside, sir.

00:09:25.916 --> 00:09:29.291
- Don't overthink this.
- What if he doesn't like hostel food?

00:09:29.875 --> 00:09:31.416
Not just that…

00:09:35.583 --> 00:09:37.666
Do you know what's more
dangerous than ghosts, Ramesh?

00:09:38.833 --> 00:09:39.708
Your imagination.

00:09:40.958 --> 00:09:42.416
And more dangerous than that…

00:09:42.666 --> 00:09:44.000
are the rumors that feed it.

00:09:45.625 --> 00:09:47.250
Shut only that room…

00:09:47.958 --> 00:09:48.958
not your minds.

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:57.583
It's an evil-eye effigy
to keep the evil spirits out.

00:10:00.166 --> 00:10:01.250
I know.

00:10:01.625 --> 00:10:02.583
But…

00:10:02.791 --> 00:10:04.500
why is it facing the college?

00:10:16.333 --> 00:10:18.500
Sir, I did everything I could.

00:10:18.958 --> 00:10:21.041
But none of them are
willing to listen to us.

00:10:21.791 --> 00:10:22.708
Be alert.

00:10:23.291 --> 00:10:24.333
Keep an eye on things.

00:10:24.625 --> 00:10:26.875
- I'm working on a solution.
- Okay, sir.

00:10:30.708 --> 00:10:32.750
<i>Why do you want this college so badly?</i>

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:34.458
You've misunderstood me.

00:10:34.958 --> 00:10:37.708
I'm not doing all this
to get that building.

00:10:38.791 --> 00:10:40.416
I'm doing it so no one gets it.

00:10:41.125 --> 00:10:42.541
That building has to be demolished.

00:11:00.333 --> 00:11:01.833
Don’t touch anything, dear.

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:03.082
They say it's COVID.

00:11:03.083 --> 00:11:05.415
Don’t give them to anyone outside.
Wash your clothes yourself.

00:11:05.416 --> 00:11:07.291
- Be careful around everyone.
- Okay.

00:11:07.958 --> 00:11:09.250
Look at your hair.

00:11:09.416 --> 00:11:10.958
You don’t even know how to comb it.

00:11:11.083 --> 00:11:12.750
You never listen when I
tell you to oil your hair.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:15.333
Apply hair oil every day so
you look presentable.

00:11:16.916 --> 00:11:17.791
Hold on.

00:11:17.916 --> 00:11:18.999
Sudha?

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:20.499
Call your mother
and tell her we’ve arrived--

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.500
Yes. I’ll call Mom right now.

00:11:23.875 --> 00:11:24.832
Mom…

00:11:24.833 --> 00:11:27.208
- Keep this. You might need it.
- Dad, it's okay.

00:11:27.375 --> 00:11:28.291
Keep it.

00:11:29.083 --> 00:11:30.583
Don't get into fights with anyone.

00:11:30.791 --> 00:11:32.625
Eat on time. Okay?

00:11:33.833 --> 00:11:34.708
Take care.

00:11:37.125 --> 00:11:38.250
Take care, Vivek.

00:11:38.708 --> 00:11:39.708
Keep in touch.

00:11:40.583 --> 00:11:42.083
Be nice to your friends.

00:11:48.583 --> 00:11:49.916
<i>Demolish the building?</i>

00:11:51.458 --> 00:11:52.541
What even happened there?

00:11:56.083 --> 00:11:57.583
Hey! Who are you?

00:11:58.208 --> 00:11:59.707
- Student or patient?
- Student, sir.

00:11:59.708 --> 00:12:00.625
- Student.
- Remove your mask!

00:12:01.708 --> 00:12:04.166
Don’t come onto campus wearing
these masks and covers. Understood?

00:12:04.666 --> 00:12:06.166
Oh! I forgot the bag!

00:12:08.125 --> 00:12:12.083
A terrible mistake was made…
one that cost many lives.

00:12:19.583 --> 00:12:20.625
Hey!

00:12:25.375 --> 00:12:27.000
Out! Out! Stop right there!

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:29.666
Sir…

00:12:30.291 --> 00:12:31.875
they don't even have a connection, sir!

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.958
Get out! Go! Out!

00:12:42.125 --> 00:12:43.416
If that building isn’t demolished,

00:12:43.791 --> 00:12:47.041
there’s no telling
how many more lives will be lost.

00:12:52.875 --> 00:12:54.291
Sir, the new students have arrived.

00:13:03.916 --> 00:13:06.375
Don't you understand?
No women are allowed inside.

00:13:06.625 --> 00:13:07.666
She's not a girl. She's his mother!

00:13:07.875 --> 00:13:10.000
I don’t care who she is.
No women are allowed inside!

00:13:11.416 --> 00:13:12.416
Give it to him.

00:13:14.541 --> 00:13:17.083
Fine then. You give it to him.

00:13:17.875 --> 00:13:20.250
- His name is Vivek.
- I'll give it to him. You can go now.

00:13:26.791 --> 00:13:28.041
<i>My name is Ramesh Kumar.</i>

00:13:28.458 --> 00:13:29.958
<i>I'm the warden of this hostel.</i>

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:32.208
<i>Just like every home,</i>

00:13:32.333 --> 00:13:33.791
<i>this one has a few rules too.</i>

00:13:34.541 --> 00:13:35.916
Curfew is at ten.

00:13:36.041 --> 00:13:37.875
Keep your rooms clean.

00:13:38.083 --> 00:13:39.416
No alcohol or cigarettes.

00:13:39.875 --> 00:13:42.250
But the most important rule is that…

00:13:42.916 --> 00:13:45.791
no girls are allowed inside this hostel!

00:13:46.458 --> 00:13:47.457
Not just girls…

00:13:47.458 --> 00:13:49.916
No woman is allowed in here
under any circumstances.

00:13:50.208 --> 00:13:51.125
Understood?

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:53.750
Collect your room keys.

00:13:56.333 --> 00:13:57.458
- Name?
- Sandeep.

00:14:02.666 --> 00:14:04.541
- Name?
- Vivek Shankar.

00:14:20.791 --> 00:14:21.916
{\an8}- Sir!
- Yes?

00:14:22.958 --> 00:14:24.000
{\an8}417

00:14:39.458 --> 00:14:40.582
Listen…

00:14:40.583 --> 00:14:42.208
The room next to yours is…

00:14:42.583 --> 00:14:43.541
418!

00:14:44.625 --> 00:14:46.666
It is always kept locked.

00:14:47.791 --> 00:14:49.166
Don't mess around with it.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.708
<i>Did they give you the keys?
Are you going to the room?</i>

00:15:01.875 --> 00:15:04.166
<i>- Keep your room clean, okay?</i>
- Okay, Mom.

00:15:04.291 --> 00:15:07.333
<i>I've given you God's photos, right?
Make sure you pray every day.</i>

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:08.457
<i>One more thing!</i>

00:15:08.458 --> 00:15:09.375
<i>Spend carefully.</i>

00:15:09.541 --> 00:15:11.083
- Okay.
<i>- Don't waste money!</i>

00:15:11.333 --> 00:15:13.333
<i>I won't be there to do your chores now.</i>

00:15:14.375 --> 00:15:15.875
<i>- Learn to do them yourself.</i>
- Okay.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:19.791
<i>Don't dress shabbily. Wear ironed clothes.</i>

00:15:20.458 --> 00:15:23.500
<i>I sent you snacks with the watchman.
Did you have them?</i>

00:15:23.791 --> 00:15:26.416
I haven't even reached my room yet.
Do you want me to eat in the corridor?

00:15:26.583 --> 00:15:29.832
<i>- Don't get smart with me!</i>
- It's not like that, Mom.

00:15:29.833 --> 00:15:33.500
- I'll eat right after I go to my room.
<i>- Don't act too smart with me.</i>

00:15:33.666 --> 00:15:36.457
<i>One more thing! Your hostel is so strict!</i>

00:15:36.458 --> 00:15:38.749
<i>Your watchman wouldn't even let me in.</i>

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:39.708
Hey!

00:15:41.541 --> 00:15:42.916
Why are you opening that room?

00:15:46.041 --> 00:15:48.000
- Have you lost your mind?
- I'll call you later, Mom!

00:15:48.125 --> 00:15:49.375
Didn't the Warden warn you?

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:54.208
The things you people do
will put our lives at risk!

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:55.791
Such careless people!

00:15:59.958 --> 00:16:01.458
- Did he give you an earful too?
- Yeah.

00:16:01.583 --> 00:16:04.791
- I wandered there by mistake.
- I went there on purpose.

00:16:06.166 --> 00:16:07.333
- 417?
- Yes.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.583
- By the way, I'm--
- Rohith, right?

00:16:09.958 --> 00:16:12.458
- I saw your name on the list. I'm… Viv--
- Vivek!

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:19.500
It looks really old from the outside,

00:16:20.125 --> 00:16:22.166
- but it's completely renovated inside.
- Yes.

00:16:22.333 --> 00:16:24.291
It was abandoned for years.

00:16:25.125 --> 00:16:27.125
- They renovated it just for the freshers.
- Oh!

00:16:29.625 --> 00:16:30.583
Hey, cutie!

00:16:32.166 --> 00:16:34.041
- This is Maggie.
- I know that.

00:16:34.416 --> 00:16:36.916
Not that Maggi… he's Maggie.

00:16:37.416 --> 00:16:40.250
- Hi!
- Why? Is he always eating Maggi noodles?

00:16:41.416 --> 00:16:42.625
You'll find out soon enough.

00:16:43.083 --> 00:16:44.541
We're going for a walk.
You coming, Maggie?

00:16:45.583 --> 00:16:47.416
Two minutes, bro…
You guys go ahead. I'll catch up.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:50.791
So, what was your NEET rank?

00:16:51.375 --> 00:16:52.250
Why?

00:16:52.583 --> 00:16:54.082
Do you choose your friends
based on their rank?

00:16:54.083 --> 00:16:55.833
- No, nothing like that.
- Show what's inside.

00:16:56.416 --> 00:16:58.125
- Clothes, sir.
- What do your parents do?

00:16:58.291 --> 00:17:00.125
My Mom's a doctor.
My Dad's a doctor too.

00:17:00.791 --> 00:17:02.291
Now they're determined to
make me one too.

00:17:02.583 --> 00:17:04.166
Then I'll marry a doctor,

00:17:04.375 --> 00:17:06.791
and our kids will become doctors as well.

00:17:07.916 --> 00:17:09.791
<i>I don't have a famous surname.</i>

00:17:10.791 --> 00:17:12.958
My mom thinks putting "Dr." before it

00:17:13.208 --> 00:17:15.375
is the next best thing.

00:17:16.333 --> 00:17:18.916
My parents aren't like that.
They gave me complete freedom…

00:17:19.541 --> 00:17:22.750
to choose
which medical college I'd suffer in.

00:17:24.375 --> 00:17:26.208
Weren't we going for a walk, bro?

00:17:26.583 --> 00:17:29.040
- We already finished our walk, Maggie.
- How could you leave without me?

00:17:29.041 --> 00:17:30.791
I told you I'd be there in two minutes!

00:17:31.625 --> 00:17:33.583
See?
He always says "two minutes",

00:17:33.875 --> 00:17:35.291
but he's never actually
ready in two minutes.

00:17:37.791 --> 00:17:39.124
It's okay, come.

00:17:39.125 --> 00:17:40.458
It was just two minutes…

00:17:48.958 --> 00:17:52.125
How do you believe
so confidently in what you can't see?

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:56.916
Though they have never won the cup…

00:17:57.583 --> 00:17:59.750
every year you say,
"This year's cup is ours."

00:18:00.291 --> 00:18:01.166
Just like that.

00:18:02.125 --> 00:18:03.000
Belief.

00:18:04.041 --> 00:18:05.291
We will win.

00:18:06.041 --> 00:18:07.250
This year's cup is ours!

00:18:10.041 --> 00:18:12.375
What are you doing inside
without opening the door?

00:18:12.916 --> 00:18:13.791
Who are you?

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:16.083
Who are you, "Sir".

00:18:17.208 --> 00:18:19.583
Don't you know you should
call seniors "Sir"?

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:20.958
Who are you, Sir?

00:18:21.083 --> 00:18:23.000
Hey! You should call him Doctor.

00:18:24.583 --> 00:18:27.291
We have arranged a
Freshers' party for you.

00:18:27.875 --> 00:18:29.166
- Really?
- Yes.

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:30.916
You're the freshers…

00:18:31.208 --> 00:18:32.291
so the party is on us!

00:18:32.458 --> 00:18:33.333
Come.

00:18:38.291 --> 00:18:40.125
Aren't there rules against ragging?

00:18:41.416 --> 00:18:42.833
Those rules aren't for us.

00:18:43.666 --> 00:18:46.291
It's for them to be safe
if something happens to us.

00:18:47.791 --> 00:18:48.791
Push! Push!

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:50.416
How much longer?

00:18:50.666 --> 00:18:52.333
Two minutes! Two minutes.

00:19:01.208 --> 00:19:02.458
- My baby!
- Hey!

00:19:02.791 --> 00:19:03.750
What are you doing?

00:19:04.666 --> 00:19:07.125
- Stop staring and answer me!
- I'm playing the trumpet.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:08.875
- What is your name?
- Neeraj.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.333
- Neeraj BJ?
- How do you know?

00:19:12.083 --> 00:19:13.250
Nothing. Continue playing the trumpet.

00:19:15.833 --> 00:19:16.833
Where is the song?

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:20.041
- Where is the song?
- Hey! Move!

00:19:21.875 --> 00:19:23.958
Bro! New students!

00:19:24.291 --> 00:19:26.208
Hey! Matching! Matching!

00:19:26.916 --> 00:19:27.875
Bro!

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:29.958
- Hero and heroine.
- Hey!

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:31.458
Hero and item.

00:19:31.625 --> 00:19:33.041
Oh! Item.

00:19:34.541 --> 00:19:37.125
What are you looking at?
You understood the character, right?

00:19:37.416 --> 00:19:39.291
- Start!
- Start!

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:47.375
Hey, four-eyes!

00:19:47.666 --> 00:19:49.625
Start, dear, start.

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:51.625
Yes!

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:54.875
Do it, man.

00:19:55.416 --> 00:19:56.291
No…

00:19:56.666 --> 00:19:58.500
the item is very decent.

00:19:58.833 --> 00:19:59.750
True.

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:01.416
Well,

00:20:01.708 --> 00:20:04.458
doesn't an item song
need a little skin show?

00:20:04.708 --> 00:20:06.625
True. You remove your shirt.

00:20:07.208 --> 00:20:09.375
- Remove!
- Sir, let's not do such things.

00:20:12.458 --> 00:20:15.708
Are heroes saving
item girls nowadays, too?

00:20:16.208 --> 00:20:18.208
Hey, you remove your shirt.

00:20:19.333 --> 00:20:20.250
Remove!

00:20:23.875 --> 00:20:24.750
Hey!

00:20:26.208 --> 00:20:28.750
Are you unable to
handle the new students?

00:20:29.625 --> 00:20:31.333
What will you do in your final year?

00:20:34.541 --> 00:20:37.708
No one can pass MBBS without
their seniors' help.

00:20:39.083 --> 00:20:40.708
If you listen to what we say…

00:20:41.875 --> 00:20:44.125
You will become doctors. Otherwise…

00:20:45.375 --> 00:20:48.125
you will become
a patient like him. Understood?

00:20:48.416 --> 00:20:49.458
Aren’t you scared of your seniors?

00:20:50.166 --> 00:20:52.666
- Oh, threatening us?
- He's in 417.

00:20:53.041 --> 00:20:54.041
I am afraid.

00:20:55.875 --> 00:20:58.041
You will be afraid. Definitely.

00:20:58.333 --> 00:21:00.916
Do you know why
your hostel was locked all along?

00:21:02.416 --> 00:21:04.666
- Why?
- Because of that one room…

00:21:05.791 --> 00:21:07.541
they closed the whole building.

00:21:09.833 --> 00:21:10.833
Now,

00:21:11.208 --> 00:21:14.665
they've given you front row
seats to that very horror film.

00:21:14.666 --> 00:21:16.166
Which room?

00:21:16.708 --> 00:21:19.250
The room next to yours.

00:21:21.541 --> 00:21:23.166
We don't have to do anything.

00:21:24.125 --> 00:21:26.208
If you stay there,
you will die all by yourself.

00:21:36.041 --> 00:21:36.958
Let's go.

00:21:42.375 --> 00:21:43.291
Rohith!

00:21:44.458 --> 00:21:46.000
You go. I'll be there.

00:21:49.208 --> 00:21:51.833
I like how you stood by your friend.

00:21:52.583 --> 00:21:53.916
Aren't they your friends?

00:21:54.541 --> 00:21:56.541
Arjun has only one friend.

00:21:56.958 --> 00:21:58.000
That's his ego.

00:21:58.541 --> 00:22:00.666
The rest of them are all his minions.

00:22:02.291 --> 00:22:07.375
When everyone called me "Doctor,"
he alone called me a patient.

00:22:08.125 --> 00:22:10.416
Don't bother, Doctor.

00:22:13.875 --> 00:22:14.750
Come.

00:22:47.000 --> 00:22:47.875
Vivek?

00:22:48.750 --> 00:22:50.750
Don't worry about it. Come.

00:23:06.500 --> 00:23:09.666
Good morning, students.
I am Dr. Krishnamurthy.

00:23:09.958 --> 00:23:11.333
Dean of this institution.

00:23:12.083 --> 00:23:13.333
Welcome to VIMS.

00:23:13.916 --> 00:23:16.708
We have had the highest
number of admissions this year.

00:23:17.166 --> 00:23:20.333
And… If you
got into this prestigious college,

00:23:20.625 --> 00:23:22.291
it's because of your hard work.

00:23:22.833 --> 00:23:25.916
He must have forgotten
the donations we gave them.

00:23:27.333 --> 00:23:29.458
MBBS is not an easy course.

00:23:29.750 --> 00:23:32.333
You might face mental or emotional stress.

00:23:32.666 --> 00:23:34.625
To help you with that,

00:23:34.958 --> 00:23:38.666
we have started a new student
counseling center, led by Dr. Patil.

00:23:48.291 --> 00:23:49.916
Thank you, Dr. Krishnamurthy.

00:23:50.916 --> 00:23:53.208
I might be appointed by the management.

00:23:53.541 --> 00:23:56.541
But I am here to help you,
the students of this college.

00:23:57.291 --> 00:23:59.375
When you feel you need help,

00:24:00.333 --> 00:24:01.375
you can come,

00:24:02.125 --> 00:24:05.125
and talk to me freely,
with full confidentiality.

00:24:05.666 --> 00:24:08.500
I am here for you, always. Thank you.

00:24:09.916 --> 00:24:12.500
Yes, yes. Dr. Patil. You are correct.

00:24:13.416 --> 00:24:16.625
Our students' welfare
is of utmost importance to us.

00:24:17.375 --> 00:24:19.291
So, in our college,

00:24:19.791 --> 00:24:21.833
we have a strict no-ragging policy too.

00:24:22.916 --> 00:24:23.791
Arjun.

00:24:24.791 --> 00:24:26.041
To implement that…

00:24:26.250 --> 00:24:28.040
- Did you file a complaint?
- No.

00:24:28.041 --> 00:24:30.000
There is an anti-ragging squad too.

00:24:30.166 --> 00:24:32.291
If anyone breaks this policy,

00:24:32.583 --> 00:24:34.500
the consequences will be dire.

00:24:34.958 --> 00:24:37.083
If you see anyone ragging on this campus,

00:24:37.500 --> 00:24:40.333
report to the head
of our anti-ragging squad…

00:24:41.333 --> 00:24:42.250
Arjun.

00:24:43.208 --> 00:24:46.250
This is a great campus
with a good ambiance.

00:24:46.375 --> 00:24:49.375
Does anyone go to a snake's burrow
to complain about a snakebite?

00:24:50.583 --> 00:24:51.540
There is a library.

00:24:51.541 --> 00:24:54.125
If you have a problem,
straight away come to me.

00:24:54.458 --> 00:24:55.415
Destiny.

00:24:55.416 --> 00:24:56.374
I mean…

00:24:56.375 --> 00:24:58.458
All of us being
in the same college at the same time…

00:24:58.833 --> 00:25:00.333
Feels like destiny, bro.

00:25:00.875 --> 00:25:02.041
Destiny, my ass.

00:25:02.458 --> 00:25:03.875
It's just a coincidence.

00:25:05.166 --> 00:25:07.916
We explored the whole college.
Where is the canteen?

00:25:08.625 --> 00:25:10.041
Haven't you gone to the canteen yet?

00:25:16.083 --> 00:25:16.958
Rohith!

00:25:18.125 --> 00:25:19.000
What happened?

00:25:21.208 --> 00:25:22.583
Saisha?

00:25:23.125 --> 00:25:24.083
I met her on the bus.

00:25:24.416 --> 00:25:25.833
- Oh!
- She is very adamant.

00:25:26.083 --> 00:25:28.541
She came from the UK to meet her father.

00:25:29.583 --> 00:25:32.833
I heard that the local girls are
beautiful, and that seems to be true.

00:25:33.583 --> 00:25:35.416
I guess it's my destiny to meet her.

00:25:36.000 --> 00:25:37.750
Didn't you say, "Destiny, my ass"?

00:25:39.166 --> 00:25:42.083
Looking at her, I feel like
believing in anything.

00:25:47.333 --> 00:25:49.125
- Saisha?
- Yeah.

00:25:49.750 --> 00:25:50.625
Follow me.

00:25:51.750 --> 00:25:53.791
I am Rohith. Dr. Rohith.

00:26:03.541 --> 00:26:05.708
- How does it look?
- 98.6.

00:26:06.583 --> 00:26:08.333
- But you look hot.
- What?

00:26:08.708 --> 00:26:11.708
You… I mean, it's hot out here, right?

00:26:12.375 --> 00:26:13.916
- Are you really a doctor?
- Yes!

00:26:14.291 --> 00:26:15.875
- Then act like it.
- I am!

00:26:16.250 --> 00:26:17.166
I mean…

00:26:17.833 --> 00:26:20.291
Okay. Let's have a look at your file.

00:26:23.000 --> 00:26:24.500
Everything seems fine here.

00:26:25.791 --> 00:26:27.791
It would have been nice
if you knew my language.

00:26:31.041 --> 00:26:31.916
What if I did?

00:26:33.500 --> 00:26:36.000
Would you have kept
everything you said to yourself?

00:26:36.541 --> 00:26:37.416
Nope.

00:26:37.708 --> 00:26:39.750
I would have told you
what is in my heart.

00:26:40.208 --> 00:26:41.208
Hey!

00:26:42.125 --> 00:26:44.166
What are you doing here? Out!

00:26:47.875 --> 00:26:48.916
Nonsense!

00:26:51.250 --> 00:26:52.833
All your symptoms point to COVID.

00:26:53.500 --> 00:26:55.041
You will have to be in quarantine.

00:26:55.291 --> 00:26:56.333
- For 14 days.
- What?

00:26:56.541 --> 00:26:59.125
This is ridiculous.
What will I do here that long?

00:26:59.500 --> 00:27:00.625
- It's COVID protocol.
- It's just--

00:27:00.750 --> 00:27:02.083
- It's not.
- Nurse.

00:27:02.333 --> 00:27:03.541
It's just allergies!

00:27:11.208 --> 00:27:13.541
It looks like the second opinion
wasn't any better.

00:27:13.875 --> 00:27:16.375
I liked the first one better.

00:27:17.208 --> 00:27:19.458
Then, I'd like to express
another opinion.

00:27:20.291 --> 00:27:22.833
In my opinion, you look very hot.

00:27:24.916 --> 00:27:27.375
In my opinion,
you should see me when I am not sick.

00:27:28.000 --> 00:27:29.541
That's exactly what I'm thinking.

00:27:29.958 --> 00:27:32.166
Don't worry that
they have put you in quarantine.

00:27:32.458 --> 00:27:35.000
It's my responsibility
to take you out of here. Okay?

00:27:36.250 --> 00:27:40.375
<i>Blue upon blue clouds above</i>

00:27:41.041 --> 00:27:45.625
<i>Let us float away like them</i>

00:27:45.833 --> 00:27:49.665
<i>Let us drift away…</i>

00:27:49.666 --> 00:27:51.915
<i>- Don't roam outside.</i>
- I won't, Amma.

00:27:51.916 --> 00:27:53.625
<i>Your stars aren't in your favor.</i>

00:27:56.166 --> 00:28:00.041
- My hand was underneath!
- Prawns fry, <i>tawa</i> prawns.

00:28:00.750 --> 00:28:02.208
Two plates of each, brother.

00:28:02.666 --> 00:28:05.041
Maggie… Why so many? It'll go to waste.

00:28:05.500 --> 00:28:09.708
- I can eat these. You order yours.
<i>- Step by step if our songs beat along</i>

00:28:09.875 --> 00:28:13.916
<i>Even the wrong notes become our melody</i>

00:28:15.625 --> 00:28:21.125
- Doctor bro!
<i>- Blue upon blue clouds above</i>

00:28:25.875 --> 00:28:30.166
<i>Let us surrender</i>

00:28:30.583 --> 00:28:33.625
<i>Let us wander away</i>

00:28:33.875 --> 00:28:36.125
Go Simran, go. Live your life.

00:28:36.333 --> 00:28:40.375
<i>Time won't circle back again</i>

00:28:41.083 --> 00:28:45.000
<i>This moment is yours alone</i>

00:28:45.875 --> 00:28:49.833
<i>Fill your breath</i>

00:28:50.083 --> 00:28:53.791
<i>With the fire of every dreams</i>

00:28:54.041 --> 00:28:58.666
<i>Hey, come on!</i>

00:28:58.958 --> 00:29:03.083
<i>We have much more to experience</i>

00:29:03.583 --> 00:29:08.790
<i>Hey, rise now!</i>

00:29:08.791 --> 00:29:12.458
<i>This ever-changing shore!</i>

00:29:16.125 --> 00:29:17.083
Saisha!

00:29:33.833 --> 00:29:38.083
<i>Blue upon blue clouds above</i>

00:29:38.625 --> 00:29:43.041
<i>Drifting softly, drifting freely</i>

00:29:43.416 --> 00:29:47.791
<i>Down the wandering winds</i>

00:29:48.250 --> 00:29:52.707
<i>Come away, come with me</i>

00:29:52.708 --> 00:29:54.833
<i>Oh!</i>

00:29:54.958 --> 00:29:59.666
<i>Blue, blue skies unfolding</i>

00:30:01.083 --> 00:30:03.916
<i>Oh!</i>

00:30:04.458 --> 00:30:08.625
<i>Let the breeze decide our path</i>

00:30:08.958 --> 00:30:12.083
<i>Shifting this way and that</i>

00:30:14.875 --> 00:30:17.582
- Serve it right!
- Come, come.

00:30:17.583 --> 00:30:19.083
One more run! One more!

00:30:22.250 --> 00:30:26.083
- One more, one more!
- Get the ball!

00:30:32.583 --> 00:30:35.500
Hey, Vivek! Vivek, what happened?

00:30:43.875 --> 00:30:46.416
<i>What's up, bro?
Haven't seen Saisha since yesterday?</i>

00:30:46.791 --> 00:30:49.208
Arjun caught us sneaking back
into the ward yesterday.

00:30:49.500 --> 00:30:51.000
She hasn't been able to come out since.

00:30:51.583 --> 00:30:54.041
- His overreaction…
- Hey, Vivek!

00:30:55.083 --> 00:30:56.375
- What happened?
- Why is there no number 13?

00:31:01.916 --> 00:31:02.875
Superstition.

00:31:03.250 --> 00:31:05.375
They believe 13 is an unlucky number.

00:31:05.666 --> 00:31:08.083
So, they avoid it on roads, on floors,

00:31:08.416 --> 00:31:10.583
on doors, and other such things.

00:31:11.875 --> 00:31:13.958
I know it's unlucky, but why so?

00:31:15.583 --> 00:31:17.583
- I mean…
- This is a Christian College.

00:31:17.791 --> 00:31:21.750
In the Last Supper, it was the 13th
disciple who backstabbed Jesus,

00:31:21.958 --> 00:31:23.833
so they consider this number unlucky.

00:31:24.500 --> 00:31:26.708
I told you. It's just superstition.

00:31:28.625 --> 00:31:29.875
This isn't superstition.

00:31:31.833 --> 00:31:33.333
It's "supper-stition"!

00:31:34.583 --> 00:31:35.916
He and his jokes!

00:31:37.166 --> 00:31:39.083
Four, one, and eight add up to thirteen!

00:31:39.541 --> 00:31:40.791
Can't bear the stench, bro.

00:31:41.208 --> 00:31:42.915
If you can't even handle
the smell of formalin--

00:31:42.916 --> 00:31:45.541
How are you going to survive, Maggie?
Did you think MBBS would be easy?

00:31:46.000 --> 00:31:47.791
Sir, Bharath N.

00:31:48.250 --> 00:31:50.458
- Hey, sign here.
- Okay. Come.

00:31:56.916 --> 00:32:00.875
We begin with the first incision,
mid line.

00:32:05.583 --> 00:32:06.750
In medicine…

00:32:07.916 --> 00:32:10.458
mess leads to mistakes.

00:32:39.083 --> 00:32:41.291
- Hey, he fell!
- What happened?

00:32:50.500 --> 00:32:52.291
- Where am I?
- Relax. Relax.

00:32:52.458 --> 00:32:53.333
Where…

00:32:54.208 --> 00:32:55.291
Doctor's clinic.

00:32:56.208 --> 00:32:58.250
- What happened?
- The cadaver--

00:32:58.583 --> 00:33:00.166
Looks like sleep deprivation.

00:33:00.833 --> 00:33:04.375
You need to start meditation,
medication, and everything immediately.

00:33:15.291 --> 00:33:16.375
God exists.

00:33:17.333 --> 00:33:20.375
If God exists,
doesn't that mean ghosts exist too?

00:33:20.541 --> 00:33:21.958
No. God exists.

00:33:23.041 --> 00:33:26.333
- He's everywhere.
- If God really exists,

00:33:26.916 --> 00:33:29.832
why would he create
a virus that kills people?

00:33:29.833 --> 00:33:31.250
I'm telling you, bro.

00:33:31.416 --> 00:33:34.208
China created this COVID virus.

00:33:34.666 --> 00:33:37.541
It's not a pandemic…
it's a "Plandemic."

00:33:37.791 --> 00:33:40.541
Shame on you, Maggie!
Are you really a medical student?

00:33:41.666 --> 00:33:43.583
Why would China do it?

00:33:44.875 --> 00:33:46.000
If anyone made it…

00:33:48.375 --> 00:33:50.333
it would've been America.

00:33:51.208 --> 00:33:53.041
What actually happened in that room?

00:33:53.250 --> 00:33:56.082
Why is everyone so scared of it?

00:33:56.083 --> 00:33:57.083
Dude…

00:33:58.541 --> 00:34:00.916
It's just a storeroom. That's it.

00:34:01.958 --> 00:34:04.500
People aren't afraid of the room itself.

00:34:05.291 --> 00:34:07.333
It's the stories built around it.

00:34:07.666 --> 00:34:11.291
But what if there's at least
some truth in those stories, bro?

00:34:11.916 --> 00:34:13.083
The truth is…

00:34:13.625 --> 00:34:15.875
nobody knows anything.

00:34:16.500 --> 00:34:19.250
That's the cause of all this fear.

00:34:22.291 --> 00:34:23.583
Exactly!

00:34:24.291 --> 00:34:27.875
Once you know the truth,
there's nothing to fear.

00:34:29.125 --> 00:34:31.790
We should see what's really
inside that room someday.

00:34:31.791 --> 00:34:34.916
Bro, why someday? Let's go right now.

00:34:35.583 --> 00:34:39.958
Who knows if we'll still have
this courage two minutes from now?

00:34:47.208 --> 00:34:50.083
You close the door and stay safe inside.

00:34:51.791 --> 00:34:52.750
Doctor bro!

00:35:00.625 --> 00:35:02.375
Rohith. No.

00:35:03.875 --> 00:35:04.958
You go inside.

00:35:05.166 --> 00:35:06.541
- Please, no.
- Go, man.

00:35:11.166 --> 00:35:12.333
Hey, Maggie.

00:35:14.375 --> 00:35:16.750
Two minutes, bro. I'll open it.

00:35:16.916 --> 00:35:20.291
In your two minutes,
the Chinese will discover another virus.

00:35:20.541 --> 00:35:21.416
Move aside.

00:35:24.833 --> 00:35:25.791
Doctor bro,

00:35:26.166 --> 00:35:28.750
- you said it was America, right?
- Hello?

00:35:29.000 --> 00:35:31.208
Correct.

00:35:33.875 --> 00:35:36.666
Boys! Change of plans.

00:35:38.000 --> 00:35:40.458
- We need to sneak another ghost out.
- What?

00:35:43.166 --> 00:35:44.083
Saisha.

00:35:52.750 --> 00:35:55.833
The apple was good.
Let's try watermelon next time.

00:35:56.333 --> 00:35:57.500
I think it'll be good.

00:36:48.958 --> 00:36:50.875
Hey! Hey, stop!

00:36:51.458 --> 00:36:53.208
Hey! What's that?

00:36:53.583 --> 00:36:55.625
- Nothing, nothing, sir!
- What's inside? Show me.

00:36:56.000 --> 00:36:56.958
Nothing, sir.

00:37:21.833 --> 00:37:24.125
- Open it! Open it!
- Sir, sir, sir. There's nothing, sir.

00:37:25.583 --> 00:37:26.500
Open!

00:37:35.125 --> 00:37:37.125
- What's going on here?
- Sir…

00:37:37.875 --> 00:37:38.791
Open it!

00:37:53.375 --> 00:37:54.291
Sir!

00:39:31.791 --> 00:39:34.041
- Go! Get lost.
- Out.

00:39:34.166 --> 00:39:36.333
- Go! Get out!
- Hey!

00:39:36.916 --> 00:39:38.958
- Go!
- Come on, out!

00:40:15.125 --> 00:40:16.458
Leave! Leave right now!

00:41:00.416 --> 00:41:02.708
<i>Vivek. Hey, Vivek.</i>

00:41:03.916 --> 00:41:05.791
Hey, Vivek! Relax, relax.

00:41:07.250 --> 00:41:08.125
It's me.

00:41:08.625 --> 00:41:09.916
Why are you sleeping here?

00:41:11.458 --> 00:41:15.500
- Last night, in the room, something--
- What did you see this time?

00:41:19.875 --> 00:41:21.125
I didn't just see something!

00:41:21.416 --> 00:41:24.125
Someone, something tried to kill me.

00:41:30.875 --> 00:41:31.791
It's okay.

00:41:32.625 --> 00:41:33.750
Yesterday was rough.

00:41:35.291 --> 00:41:39.875
You shouldn't have been smoking up
while you were stressed.

00:41:42.208 --> 00:41:43.958
- It was probably just a nightmare.
- No!

00:41:45.750 --> 00:41:46.916
- See this.
- Oh!

00:41:47.916 --> 00:41:52.208
- Is that from your fall in cadaver class?
- If that's from my fall, then what's this?

00:41:58.541 --> 00:41:59.750
Those bastards!

00:42:00.333 --> 00:42:02.583
- Did seniors come to our room last night?
- No!

00:42:02.958 --> 00:42:06.000
- There's no way they could've done this!
- Then how did you get this injury?

00:42:07.208 --> 00:42:09.124
All of this happened because of you guys!

00:42:09.125 --> 00:42:10.999
Everyone warned you
not to go near that room,

00:42:11.000 --> 00:42:12.833
but you ignored them, and opened the door.

00:42:13.125 --> 00:42:16.208
- That's why all this happened.
- We never opened that door.

00:42:16.458 --> 00:42:19.291
- I won't be here anymore!
- Vivek, calm down.

00:42:19.916 --> 00:42:22.332
- Just listen.
- If I stay in that room, I'll either die…

00:42:22.333 --> 00:42:24.333
- What?
- Or lose my mind.

00:42:24.708 --> 00:42:27.541
- Nothing like that is going to happen.
- I'm not going back to that room.

00:42:27.708 --> 00:42:30.250
- Vivek.
- I'm never stepping into the hostel again.

00:42:30.583 --> 00:42:32.625
- Listen to me, please. Vivek…
- I'm going home!

00:42:38.291 --> 00:42:40.625
- Hey! What did you do?
- Hey! Watch your mouth.

00:42:41.083 --> 00:42:42.041
Why are you yelling?

00:42:42.500 --> 00:42:44.333
If you've got a problem
with me, talk to me.

00:42:44.500 --> 00:42:46.333
- Why are you dragging him into this?
- Him?

00:42:46.708 --> 00:42:48.958
Who else, bro? His heroine.

00:42:49.833 --> 00:42:50.750
Item!

00:42:50.916 --> 00:42:52.957
Hey, you think we have
nothing better to do?

00:42:52.958 --> 00:42:55.000
Go get your "item" checked.

00:42:55.250 --> 00:42:56.583
She seems crazy.

00:42:57.541 --> 00:42:58.583
How dare you hit him!

00:42:58.750 --> 00:43:00.583
If you say one more
thing about him, I'll kill you.

00:43:01.458 --> 00:43:03.750
Not now. The lecturers are coming.

00:43:04.500 --> 00:43:08.125
- Listen to me. Let's just leave.
- I know exactly where to hit you.

00:43:08.500 --> 00:43:10.125
I'm warning you, asshole.

00:43:16.208 --> 00:43:18.416
Sir, what time is the bus to Bengaluru?

00:43:18.708 --> 00:43:20.125
There are no buses until evening.

00:43:36.708 --> 00:43:38.624
- Mom, I…
<i>- Hello, Vivek, how are you, son?</i>

00:43:38.625 --> 00:43:41.624
<i>I saw the photos you sent.
You look so handsome in that white coat.</i>

00:43:41.625 --> 00:43:43.041
<i>I hope nobody's evil eye falls on you.</i>

00:43:43.166 --> 00:43:45.040
<i>Your father was so proud to see you too.</i>

00:43:45.041 --> 00:43:46.790
<i>I'll call you again when he's back.</i>

00:43:46.791 --> 00:43:48.625
<i>He went to the bank regarding a loan.</i>

00:43:48.833 --> 00:43:51.250
<i>- He's calling me. I'll call you back.</i>
- Mom?

00:43:53.833 --> 00:43:55.915
<i>The moment you said
you wanted to study here,</i>

00:43:55.916 --> 00:43:58.833
<i>your father mortgaged everything
we had to make it happen.</i>

00:44:02.416 --> 00:44:03.333
Vivek!

00:44:07.833 --> 00:44:09.125
Vivek Shankar!

00:44:09.583 --> 00:44:10.625
- Present--
- Ma'am!

00:44:11.583 --> 00:44:13.166
- Vishnuvardhan!
- Present, ma'am!

00:44:18.000 --> 00:44:20.665
Today we're going to discuss
about neuro-system.

00:44:20.666 --> 00:44:23.000
What a relief! You came back to class.

00:44:23.583 --> 00:44:25.583
We thought you weren't
coming back, you know?

00:44:26.791 --> 00:44:29.125
I have to stay here. I have to study.

00:44:29.416 --> 00:44:32.416
That's okay. But you could at least
go back to your room and freshen up first.

00:44:33.333 --> 00:44:34.208
I told you.

00:44:35.500 --> 00:44:36.916
I'm not going back to that room.

00:44:44.791 --> 00:44:49.166
Brother, brother.
Please change my room, brother. Please.

00:44:49.541 --> 00:44:51.208
- AC or non-AC?
- Brother, please…

00:44:51.500 --> 00:44:53.958
- Any room in any hostel will do!
- There isn't a single room available.

00:44:54.125 --> 00:44:56.165
Brother, I can't go back to that room.

00:44:56.166 --> 00:44:58.082
- Hey! Didn't you hear the Dean?
- Please understand, brother.

00:44:58.083 --> 00:45:01.208
- There are no vacant rooms, man.
- Then I'll find a room somewhere else.

00:45:01.333 --> 00:45:03.207
- Hey, listen to me.
- I'll find a room outside. Not here!

00:45:03.208 --> 00:45:05.708
Hey, not just here. You won't
find a room anywhere in this town!

00:45:05.875 --> 00:45:09.290
Hey, Nobody in this town
rents rooms to students from your college.

00:45:09.291 --> 00:45:11.790
- Sir, no, sir…
- They come from outside, drink…

00:45:11.791 --> 00:45:14.541
- No…
- Smoke, bring girls over, do drugs,

00:45:14.791 --> 00:45:17.500
- and trash the place.
- Sir…

00:45:17.666 --> 00:45:19.540
Especially for your college students,

00:45:19.541 --> 00:45:21.290
- no one here will rent them a room.
- Sir…

00:45:21.291 --> 00:45:22.999
Please, sir. I'm not one of those people!

00:45:23.000 --> 00:45:26.375
- Please! I have nowhere to stay, sir.
- Hey! Go look for a place somewhere else.

00:45:26.583 --> 00:45:27.791
Sir! Sir!

00:45:28.583 --> 00:45:29.458
Sir, please!

00:46:11.708 --> 00:46:14.833
<i>"Yaksha" means spirit, "Gana" means song.</i>

00:46:15.083 --> 00:46:17.832
<i>"Yakshagana" is a traditional
performing art</i>

00:46:17.833 --> 00:46:21.457
<i>that blends music, dance, and drama.</i>

00:46:21.458 --> 00:46:26.833
<i>It is especially popular in Karnataka's
coastal regions and Malnad regions.</i>

00:46:28.833 --> 00:46:30.125
<i>He just had a bad trip.</i>

00:46:31.208 --> 00:46:33.916
<i>- He'll be fine.
- This is all because of you.</i>

00:46:35.083 --> 00:46:37.333
Hey! Don't put this on me.

00:46:38.208 --> 00:46:39.958
I already gave a disclaimer.

00:46:40.541 --> 00:46:41.541
Disclaimer?

00:46:43.208 --> 00:46:44.875
I told you that very day in the room.

00:46:46.041 --> 00:46:49.207
Bro, you explain the advertisement
slowly so everyone understands,

00:46:49.208 --> 00:46:52.457
but rush through the disclaimer. How's
anyone supposed to understand it, bro?

00:46:52.458 --> 00:46:54.000
Say it a little slower.

00:46:55.208 --> 00:46:56.083
Listen.

00:46:57.125 --> 00:47:01.457
This is a general warning regarding
the recreational use of cannabis

00:47:01.458 --> 00:47:06.291
and other mind-altering
psychoactive substances.

00:47:10.500 --> 00:47:12.291
<i>Short-term side effects include…</i>

00:47:13.041 --> 00:47:14.125
<i>anxiety…</i>

00:47:14.916 --> 00:47:16.041
<i>desperation…</i>

00:47:16.916 --> 00:47:17.833
<i>paranoia.</i>

00:47:18.666 --> 00:47:20.708
<i>Such feelings may increase.</i>

00:47:22.041 --> 00:47:23.625
<i>Users may experience mental fog.</i>

00:47:25.041 --> 00:47:28.333
<i>And sometimes…
you may hear voices that aren't there.</i>

00:47:29.666 --> 00:47:32.708
<i>Or… experience visual hallucinations.</i>

00:48:12.625 --> 00:48:16.125
- Didn't you say it'd wear off in two days?
- He had a bad trip.

00:48:21.458 --> 00:48:23.083
<i>Impaired concentration,</i>

00:48:24.125 --> 00:48:25.708
<i>delayed reaction time,</i>

00:48:26.958 --> 00:48:28.791
<i>and reduced cognitive clarity.</i>

00:48:32.791 --> 00:48:34.750
<i>Cannabis may trigger paranoia…</i>

00:48:38.375 --> 00:48:39.375
<i>which means</i>

00:48:40.333 --> 00:48:43.416
<i>you may begin to believe
that someone…</i>

00:48:44.708 --> 00:48:47.500
<i>Or something is watching you.</i>

00:48:49.458 --> 00:48:51.958
<i>Users may experience anxiety…</i>

00:48:54.208 --> 00:48:56.583
<i>and episodes of dissociation.</i>

00:48:57.375 --> 00:49:00.250
<i>In light of these potential side effects,</i>

00:49:00.916 --> 00:49:03.041
<i>user discretion is advised.</i>

00:49:19.500 --> 00:49:21.999
{\an8}Students sneak girl inside suitcase
in boys’ hostel…

00:49:22.000 --> 00:49:23.583
{\an8}That girl is from your college, right?

00:49:28.833 --> 00:49:31.415
It would have helped to give
1000 rupees to the watchman.

00:49:31.416 --> 00:49:33.416
What's all this fuss for?

00:49:33.625 --> 00:49:37.250
Because there are only two rules
that are strictly followed there.

00:49:38.208 --> 00:49:40.958
One, girls cannot enter our hostel.

00:49:41.416 --> 00:49:45.291
Second, no one should go near that room.

00:49:45.500 --> 00:49:46.375
What room?

00:49:47.166 --> 00:49:48.041
Room 418.

00:49:49.166 --> 00:49:50.166
What is in that room?

00:49:50.875 --> 00:49:52.583
We went that day to find out.

00:49:53.500 --> 00:49:55.666
You called, right?
We returned without finding out.

00:49:56.250 --> 00:49:58.083
Then let's go!
I will come along this time.

00:50:08.375 --> 00:50:09.291
Saisha…

00:50:09.625 --> 00:50:13.125
no one gets malaria or dengue
in our hostel. Do you know why?

00:50:13.416 --> 00:50:16.500
Because the watchman does not allow
even a female mosquito inside.

00:50:19.500 --> 00:50:21.125
I cannot help you this time around.

00:50:21.583 --> 00:50:23.958
Who asked for your help?
I am letting you know that I am going.

00:50:24.375 --> 00:50:26.500
Do you think
it's as easy as leaving our hospital?

00:50:27.125 --> 00:50:28.500
You cannot do it. Take it easy!

00:50:29.666 --> 00:50:32.666
You know what? Not just the hostel,
I will enter that room too.

00:50:33.708 --> 00:50:35.958
Not just you… even
the Prime Minister cannot stop me!

00:51:08.083 --> 00:51:09.750
Sorry, sorry! It's me.

00:51:11.000 --> 00:51:12.208
Did you hear anything?

00:51:14.041 --> 00:51:16.500
What did you hear now? It has been
many days since you left that room.

00:51:16.625 --> 00:51:17.791
Are you still like that?

00:51:22.500 --> 00:51:26.291
I came here to talk to you and help you.
But matters have gone out of control.

00:51:26.916 --> 00:51:30.708
- You need professional help.
- Are you saying I have gone mad?

00:51:32.583 --> 00:51:35.541
Being a medical college student,
how can you talk like that?

00:51:36.041 --> 00:51:38.166
We go to a doctor
when we catch a cold, right?

00:51:38.875 --> 00:51:41.375
This is similar to that.
Go and meet Dr. Patil.

00:51:42.708 --> 00:51:43.875
<i>I think he will help.</i>

00:51:47.791 --> 00:51:49.583
<i>Hi, Vivek. So…</i>

00:51:50.041 --> 00:51:51.458
<i>what brings you here today?</i>

00:51:52.291 --> 00:51:57.500
<i>My roommate sent me here,
thinking you might be able to help me.</i>

00:51:58.500 --> 00:52:01.916
Why did your roommate think…
that you might need my help?

00:52:02.125 --> 00:52:03.916
I cannot sleep well.

00:52:04.208 --> 00:52:07.208
I can't concentrate on anything.
That's why.

00:52:08.500 --> 00:52:12.541
- How long has it been like this?
- It started the day I came here.

00:52:15.333 --> 00:52:17.750
What happened on the day you arrived?

00:52:18.291 --> 00:52:21.916
In order to pay my donation,
my father mortgaged our house and shop.

00:52:22.541 --> 00:52:24.208
I came to know about it that day.

00:52:25.083 --> 00:52:28.166
When you came to know about it…
how did you feel?

00:52:28.666 --> 00:52:31.916
Sharing one's troubles
might lighten the burden…

00:52:32.291 --> 00:52:34.666
but sharing hopes would
increase the burden, sir.

00:52:35.500 --> 00:52:36.500
I can't fail.

00:52:36.791 --> 00:52:38.875
What makes you think you will fail, Vivek?

00:52:39.583 --> 00:52:41.791
Is there something that's bothering you?

00:52:44.958 --> 00:52:47.375
- Sir.
- I am in the middle of a session, Raju!

00:52:47.500 --> 00:52:48.541
Emergency, sir.

00:52:52.833 --> 00:52:54.790
I am sorry, I have to leave.
There's an emergency.

00:52:54.791 --> 00:52:56.541
I will reschedule your appointment.
Thank you!

00:53:00.666 --> 00:53:01.916
<i>For about three months…</i>

00:53:02.208 --> 00:53:05.458
<i>this patient met many doctors,
complaining of severe headaches.</i>

00:53:06.041 --> 00:53:09.416
<i>No medication was of use,
until the scans revealed this.</i>

00:53:10.958 --> 00:53:13.750
<i>The doctors hadn't checked
her medical history.</i>

00:53:14.750 --> 00:53:17.500
{\an8}That her recent COVID-19 infection

00:53:17.666 --> 00:53:19.791
had caused mucormycosis,

00:53:20.250 --> 00:53:21.916
that is, black fungus.

00:53:22.125 --> 00:53:24.458
So, to be a good doctor,

00:53:24.666 --> 00:53:27.333
you have to investigate
the history of your patient.

00:53:31.291 --> 00:53:34.208
You have to look at the past,
not just the symptoms.

00:53:39.500 --> 00:53:42.541
Because the past… leaves clues.

00:53:43.791 --> 00:53:45.207
<i>To be a good doctor…</i>

00:53:45.208 --> 00:53:46.874
<i>Leaves clues.</i>

00:53:46.875 --> 00:53:48.708
<i>You have to look at the past!</i>

00:53:57.291 --> 00:54:01.333
{\an8}- Where are the newspaper archives?
- Go straight and take the staircase.

00:54:42.125 --> 00:54:43.874
<i>Dr. Patil isn't new around here.</i>

00:54:43.875 --> 00:54:46.750
- How many years has it been Dr. Patil?
- The early 90s.

00:54:55.208 --> 00:54:57.083
<i>Now you are not near that room, right?</i>

00:54:57.208 --> 00:54:58.083
Why still?

00:54:58.375 --> 00:54:59.791
<i>Rohith is still there, right?</i>

00:55:00.291 --> 00:55:02.666
I somehow managed to escape that night.

00:55:03.583 --> 00:55:07.583
Before something happens to him,
we need to find out what happened there.

00:55:15.375 --> 00:55:16.915
{\an8}<i>Rohith, everything you said is true.</i>

00:55:16.916 --> 00:55:18.916
<i>Whatever happened to me
is not because of opening that room.</i>

00:55:19.208 --> 00:55:21.583
All that happened
because Rachana entered our hostel.

00:55:21.791 --> 00:55:24.375
I checked the time.

00:55:24.875 --> 00:55:27.708
It all happened exactly when
Rachana entered our hostel.

00:55:29.916 --> 00:55:31.833
Why aren't women allowed in this hostel?

00:55:32.750 --> 00:55:36.291
- Because this is a boys' hostel.
- But you didn't even let my mother in!

00:55:38.166 --> 00:55:39.083
Anyway…

00:55:39.666 --> 00:55:40.750
we will find out soon.

00:55:41.291 --> 00:55:42.833
Saisha is coming in next week.

00:55:43.208 --> 00:55:44.166
What?!

00:55:46.666 --> 00:55:48.750
She is not capable of that. Take it easy!

00:55:51.291 --> 00:55:53.416
When nature is
about to unleash a disaster…

00:55:54.666 --> 00:55:57.541
birds and animals sense it in advance.

00:55:58.166 --> 00:56:02.083
I have never seen a bird inside this gate,
in so many years of my service.

00:56:16.916 --> 00:56:18.500
You should not stay in that room.

00:56:19.333 --> 00:56:21.666
Do not let Saisha
come anywhere near the hostel.

00:56:24.041 --> 00:56:26.541
If you tell Saisha not to do something,
she'll do it twice as much.

00:56:27.916 --> 00:56:29.708
Lately, you have become just like her.

00:56:34.541 --> 00:56:36.166
We too sense it at times,

00:56:36.625 --> 00:56:39.000
but our mind dismisses it.

00:56:47.375 --> 00:56:48.833
Do you also feel something?

00:56:58.125 --> 00:57:00.500
Please read this statement and sign, sir.

00:57:03.041 --> 00:57:04.500
Sir! Please!

00:57:04.750 --> 00:57:06.208
Don't hit me! Please!

00:57:06.833 --> 00:57:11.083
- Sir! Sir! Please don't--
- Hey! Beat those scoundrels.

00:57:12.208 --> 00:57:13.083
Sir.

00:57:15.083 --> 00:57:18.083
- Which case file did you say?
- Vedagiri Mental Hospital case.

00:57:18.750 --> 00:57:21.458
After the murders
that happened there in 2005,

00:57:21.666 --> 00:57:22.875
the building was closed, right?

00:58:09.958 --> 00:58:12.791
- Hey!
- Sir, sir! Sir, no!

00:58:13.041 --> 00:58:13.916
Sir, sir!

00:58:14.083 --> 00:58:16.583
Sir, no! Sir, please, sir. Sir!

00:58:17.750 --> 00:58:19.750
It is time! Move! Keep going.

00:58:23.083 --> 00:58:23.958
Sir!

00:58:25.041 --> 00:58:26.875
You said someone else came for that file.

00:58:27.541 --> 00:58:28.416
Who was that?

00:58:38.125 --> 00:58:39.125
What do you want?

00:58:40.250 --> 00:58:42.833
Sir, there used to be a girl
named Kavya here, right?

00:58:43.083 --> 00:58:44.833
I need to speak to her father.

00:58:45.250 --> 00:58:48.457
It's about that incident
that took place in the mental hospital…

00:58:48.458 --> 00:58:50.041
That place is a bad omen.

00:58:50.250 --> 00:58:53.083
Despite all warnings,
they admitted that girl there.

00:58:53.208 --> 00:58:54.583
She died there.

00:58:54.791 --> 00:58:57.333
After a few years,
he too died from grief.

00:58:57.916 --> 00:58:59.083
It was all good here.

00:58:59.291 --> 00:59:01.500
Not sure what happened
to her after going there.

00:59:01.666 --> 00:59:03.999
However, she couldn't even kill an ant.

00:59:04.000 --> 00:59:06.375
How could anyone believe
she killed so many people?

00:59:10.208 --> 00:59:11.083
Sir!

00:59:11.875 --> 00:59:13.750
Did Kavya perform <i>Yakshagana?</i>

00:59:14.208 --> 00:59:15.166
<i>Yakshagana?</i>

00:59:15.541 --> 00:59:18.500
That girl could barely eat.
How could she have danced?

00:59:20.333 --> 00:59:22.125
<i>Why did Kavya do all that?</i>

00:59:22.458 --> 00:59:25.083
<i>I went to speak with her father,
but he too had died.</i>

00:59:25.458 --> 00:59:28.791
<i>Now, how am I supposed to find out
what happened there? Whom shall I ask?</i>

00:59:29.500 --> 00:59:32.958
Was Kavya the reason behind
all that happened in that room that night?

00:59:33.458 --> 00:59:36.208
But… Why was the anklet sound heard?

00:59:36.583 --> 00:59:38.750
What does any of this have to do
with <i>Yakshagana?</i>

00:59:39.083 --> 00:59:40.666
Oh, <i>Yakshagana,</i> is it?

00:59:43.583 --> 00:59:45.083
It's happening in our village.

00:59:47.000 --> 00:59:49.291
Hey, Udayanna! I'm coming.

01:01:17.916 --> 01:01:18.791
Rohith!

01:01:20.958 --> 01:01:21.833
Rohith!

01:01:49.166 --> 01:01:50.333
What did you do, dude?

01:01:58.375 --> 01:01:59.250
It's okay.

01:02:04.875 --> 01:02:06.958
Sorry, sir. I didn't do it on purpose.

01:02:07.208 --> 01:02:08.291
It was a dream…

01:02:08.416 --> 01:02:10.250
- A nightmare. By mistake--
- It's okay. It's okay.

01:02:10.375 --> 01:02:12.166
It's okay. It's okay.

01:02:13.625 --> 01:02:14.500
Calm down.

01:02:17.500 --> 01:02:18.416
Who's this?

01:02:21.250 --> 01:02:22.125
My roommate.

01:02:23.875 --> 01:02:26.208
I have no problem with him being here.

01:02:31.125 --> 01:02:32.416
{\an8}Now tell me, Vivek.

01:02:34.375 --> 01:02:35.625
{\an8}What's going on?

01:02:35.875 --> 01:02:38.125
{\an8}Nothing, sir,
it was just a nightmare, that's all.

01:02:38.500 --> 01:02:39.833
I don't have any other problem.

01:02:42.000 --> 01:02:44.666
Last time,
we met for a regular session, Vivek.

01:02:46.500 --> 01:02:49.750
But now, I have to submit
your evaluation to the college.

01:02:50.500 --> 01:02:53.833
So, tell me exactly what's going on.

01:02:59.083 --> 01:03:00.958
No one will believe me
even if I tell them, sir.

01:03:02.500 --> 01:03:03.500
And, why is that?

01:03:06.208 --> 01:03:07.625
One day in cadaver class…

01:03:10.000 --> 01:03:11.166
It's all just an illusion.

01:03:11.791 --> 01:03:12.708
That's why.

01:03:13.916 --> 01:03:16.375
But that night, whatever happened
in my room is true, sir.

01:03:17.625 --> 01:03:18.500
What happened?

01:03:21.833 --> 01:03:25.791
That night, I felt like
something was there in my room.

01:03:27.083 --> 01:03:28.041
It…

01:03:30.083 --> 01:03:31.708
it tried to kill me.

01:03:32.291 --> 01:03:34.375
And, do you believe…

01:03:35.166 --> 01:03:37.040
that all this is really happening?

01:03:37.041 --> 01:03:39.458
It isn't my belief.
It all really happened.

01:03:43.875 --> 01:03:47.958
Were you under the influence
of any substance that night?

01:03:51.041 --> 01:03:52.000
Don't worry.

01:03:52.500 --> 01:03:54.916
Everything you say here is confidential.

01:03:55.416 --> 01:03:56.291
I assure you.

01:03:58.458 --> 01:03:59.833
That day…

01:04:01.708 --> 01:04:04.166
I smoked weed for the first time, sir.

01:04:08.625 --> 01:04:10.916
Marijuana can cause hallucinations.

01:04:12.333 --> 01:04:15.332
That could be the reason
all that happened to you.

01:04:15.333 --> 01:04:17.791
No, that wasn't
the reason all that happened!

01:04:19.458 --> 01:04:20.625
All that happened…

01:04:21.416 --> 01:04:23.958
- because of that room.
- Which room?

01:04:25.833 --> 01:04:27.833
The corner room on fourth floor.

01:04:29.958 --> 01:04:30.833
Room 418.

01:04:33.708 --> 01:04:37.458
- I used to be in the room right beside it.
- What do you mean, you used to be?

01:04:38.666 --> 01:04:40.458
I never went back there, after that day.

01:04:43.000 --> 01:04:44.333
Staying beside that room…

01:04:44.916 --> 01:04:46.375
I don't understand
what happened to me, sir.

01:04:47.750 --> 01:04:49.416
Do you believe…

01:04:50.083 --> 01:04:52.708
there's something there
that could harm you?

01:04:53.333 --> 01:04:54.208
Yes.

01:04:56.666 --> 01:04:57.583
Okay!

01:04:59.250 --> 01:05:00.375
I understand.

01:05:02.500 --> 01:05:05.666
Has something like this
happened to your roommate?

01:05:07.250 --> 01:05:08.125
No.

01:05:09.458 --> 01:05:10.750
He doesn't believe any of this.

01:05:11.500 --> 01:05:15.250
So, you mean all this will happen
only if he believes what you're saying?

01:05:20.083 --> 01:05:21.625
I am not imagining all this!

01:05:22.916 --> 01:05:25.041
What I saw
cannot be imagined by anyone!

01:05:25.875 --> 01:05:28.250
I thought, at least,
you would understand what I'm saying!

01:05:28.375 --> 01:05:30.666
But you, too, don't believe me,
just like everyone else!

01:05:33.041 --> 01:05:34.333
I may be scared, sir…

01:05:35.583 --> 01:05:36.750
but I am not crazy.

01:05:37.416 --> 01:05:40.208
- I know what happened there.
- What happened, Vivek?

01:05:40.416 --> 01:05:42.374
That building used to be a mental asylum!

01:05:42.375 --> 01:05:44.750
I know. I worked there. What about it?

01:05:46.166 --> 01:05:47.041
Kavya…

01:05:47.833 --> 01:05:50.416
she killed so many people
in that building, and died in that room.

01:05:50.666 --> 01:05:51.750
What do you have to say about it?

01:05:52.708 --> 01:05:54.583
{\an8}I was not there
when that incident happened.

01:05:56.625 --> 01:05:58.166
{\an8}But she was a mental patient.

01:05:59.791 --> 01:06:03.875
{\an8}What's surprising about something
like this happening in a mental asylum?

01:06:05.500 --> 01:06:07.875
Okay, I agree.

01:06:08.666 --> 01:06:10.875
I'll believe all that has happened to you.

01:06:11.583 --> 01:06:14.000
Let's find out the reasons behind it.

01:06:14.291 --> 01:06:16.500
Let me help you. Please sit down.

01:06:22.375 --> 01:06:23.541
Now, tell me, Vivek.

01:06:24.833 --> 01:06:27.416
What happened after that night?

01:06:33.833 --> 01:06:35.083
After that night…

01:06:36.916 --> 01:06:39.708
wherever I go, whatever I do,

01:06:40.333 --> 01:06:42.291
I keep seeing what I saw that night.

01:06:43.750 --> 01:06:45.541
When I close my eyes to
avoid seeing it…

01:06:46.916 --> 01:06:48.583
that same song echoes in my ears.

01:06:50.333 --> 01:06:51.333
Which song?

01:06:52.708 --> 01:06:54.583
It… sounded like…

01:06:56.041 --> 01:06:57.375
some kind of lullaby.

01:07:00.458 --> 01:07:03.375
But it isn't a lullaby
that puts you to sleep.

01:07:04.333 --> 01:07:05.708
It won't let you sleep!

01:07:08.041 --> 01:07:09.458
Where did you hear it?

01:07:10.708 --> 01:07:11.666
From that room.

01:07:21.083 --> 01:07:22.375
What do you know about it?

01:07:45.333 --> 01:07:47.375
Is this the song?

01:07:49.041 --> 01:07:49.916
No.

01:07:51.833 --> 01:07:53.000
Not just this song…

01:07:56.916 --> 01:07:58.000
but this voice too!

01:08:19.958 --> 01:08:20.833
Kavya?

01:08:22.083 --> 01:08:24.166
All this did not happen because of Kavya.

01:08:25.958 --> 01:08:27.791
She was just another patient.

01:08:29.541 --> 01:08:31.208
What happened in that room?

01:08:35.625 --> 01:08:38.083
Before you know
what happened in that room…

01:08:40.875 --> 01:08:42.791
you must know who was in there.

01:08:54.166 --> 01:08:55.291
<i>What's your name?</i>

01:09:01.416 --> 01:09:02.291
<i>Devika.</i>

01:09:07.333 --> 01:09:09.083
{\an8}<i>-What's your name?
- Kamsa!</i>

01:09:09.875 --> 01:09:13.291
<i>Devaki's eighth child will be your death!</i>

01:09:17.333 --> 01:09:18.291
{\an8}<i>Devika.</i>

01:09:20.333 --> 01:09:21.916
<i>Devika was an orphan.</i>

01:09:23.208 --> 01:09:27.791
<i>She grew up among
the performers of a</i> Yakshagana <i>troupe.</i>

01:09:29.500 --> 01:09:32.583
<i>People would come in large crowds…</i>

01:09:33.375 --> 01:09:35.833
<i>to watch the</i> Yakshagana
<i>performances in this village.</i>

01:09:36.250 --> 01:09:38.082
- Don't be so heartless, brother.
<i>- Most of them</i>

01:09:38.083 --> 01:09:41.166
<i>- would come to see Devika!</i>
- Without a lamp, there is no light.

01:09:41.458 --> 01:09:44.375
<i>- But she had no family.</i>
- Without Devaki…

01:09:44.500 --> 01:09:46.958
<i>- Until Mohan saw her.</i>
- There's no eighth child.

01:09:48.375 --> 01:09:50.125
Kill me instead, brother.

01:09:56.500 --> 01:10:00.125
<i>Anyone would like Devika
the minute they met her.</i>

01:10:02.875 --> 01:10:05.125
<i>Will they let me into your home?</i>

01:10:06.291 --> 01:10:08.666
<i>Mohan took an instant liking to her.</i>

01:10:12.750 --> 01:10:15.958
For twenty-five years,
I've dedicated my life to this art.

01:10:17.041 --> 01:10:17.958
But…

01:10:26.000 --> 01:10:29.791
Devika used to smile only when
she put on makeup and performed.

01:10:33.000 --> 01:10:36.500
If they won't let you in,
I'll leave that place myself.

01:10:36.750 --> 01:10:42.000
<i>That day, Devika was smiling
without any makeup or performance.</i>

01:10:42.208 --> 01:10:45.083
<i>But a new beginning awaits me now.</i>

01:11:04.416 --> 01:11:10.458
<i>No one could have imagined that her
first step, marked with vermilion…</i>

01:11:11.583 --> 01:11:13.791
would end in a journey stained with blood.

01:11:15.416 --> 01:11:20.416
<i>Devika found herself in a wife's role
after performing as Devaki.</i>

01:11:22.583 --> 01:11:24.166
How's married life treating you?

01:11:24.750 --> 01:11:26.708
I took care of myself all these years.

01:11:27.500 --> 01:11:32.000
Now, I have my love as my husband.
What more could I ask for?

01:11:33.833 --> 01:11:36.124
- There is one thing, Devika.
<i>- A wish emerged in her heart.</i>

01:11:36.125 --> 01:11:38.833
- Mohan!
- He is the only heir to his family.

01:11:39.500 --> 01:11:42.666
He went against everyone to marry you.

01:11:43.333 --> 01:11:46.791
- Now it's upon you to give him an heir.
- For our child.

01:11:47.041 --> 01:11:51.083
<i>- They made that into her wish.</i>
- Yellow!

01:11:51.541 --> 01:11:53.291
Do you wish for a girl or a boy?

01:11:53.833 --> 01:11:56.250
I have no preference,
but I want many kids.

01:11:57.375 --> 01:11:58.625
That's your duty.

01:12:02.291 --> 01:12:04.250
I want a son just like you.

01:12:09.666 --> 01:12:11.666
I want a daughter with eyes like yours.

01:12:13.875 --> 01:12:16.125
Motherhood is not easy.

01:12:18.000 --> 01:12:21.125
You need both good health
and good fortune on your side.

01:12:22.291 --> 01:12:24.708
- What do I do?
- Do this.

01:12:25.541 --> 01:12:28.458
<i>There is a Gowramma temple
on the outskirts of the village.</i>

01:12:29.208 --> 01:12:31.083
<i>Go there and offer prayers.</i>

01:12:32.791 --> 01:12:36.041
- Okay.
<i>- Your diet needs to change too.</i>

01:12:40.916 --> 01:12:41.791
Okay.

01:12:42.500 --> 01:12:45.291
Your efforts alone won't be enough.

01:12:50.000 --> 01:12:51.041
<i>Slowly…</i>

01:12:52.083 --> 01:12:56.791
the words she heard
began echoing in her heart.

01:12:58.041 --> 01:12:59.250
What are you doing here?

01:13:00.833 --> 01:13:03.125
- It's an auspicious day today.
- Yes.

01:13:04.083 --> 01:13:06.416
The wedding is going on
without any hurdles.

01:13:07.000 --> 01:13:09.041
Pay a little attention to Mohan too.

01:13:25.666 --> 01:13:27.041
What, now?

01:13:28.791 --> 01:13:30.208
<i>A baby arrived in the family.</i>

01:13:31.250 --> 01:13:32.541
<i>Everyone was delighted.</i>

01:13:33.333 --> 01:13:36.125
<i>But that baby wasn't mine.</i>

01:13:38.583 --> 01:13:39.750
The baby looks just like you.

01:13:45.250 --> 01:13:46.625
I will be a mother, right?

01:13:47.375 --> 01:13:50.375
Everything's normal. Don't stop trying.

01:13:51.125 --> 01:13:53.208
I'll prescribe medicines
for your general health.

01:13:53.750 --> 01:13:55.625
What's the use if the Doctor prescribes?

01:13:57.500 --> 01:13:59.125
It must be written in fate too.

01:14:02.791 --> 01:14:06.375
- Maybe there's something wrong with me.
- Isn't this new?

01:14:06.958 --> 01:14:09.708
- Isn't this for your daughter-in-law?
- No, no.

01:14:10.958 --> 01:14:13.166
This was made for Ramya.

01:14:14.041 --> 01:14:15.791
Oh, you didn't know, right?

01:14:16.166 --> 01:14:19.041
They wanted Mohan to marry
Ramya from the very beginning.

01:14:26.500 --> 01:14:29.083
You will become a mother.
Everything will be fine.

01:14:30.541 --> 01:14:32.790
Sister, please get some milk for the baby.

01:14:32.791 --> 01:14:33.958
Why is he crying?

01:14:56.666 --> 01:15:02.333
<i>I sing this sweet lullaby for you</i>

01:15:02.625 --> 01:15:08.166
<i>My dear child</i>

01:15:08.625 --> 01:15:14.125
<i>Like the night sky cradles the moon</i>

01:15:14.541 --> 01:15:20.916
<i>I shall cradle you, my little one</i>

01:15:21.375 --> 01:15:26.750
<i>The stars have slipped</i>

01:15:27.583 --> 01:15:32.083
<i>From the heavens</i>

01:15:33.375 --> 01:15:36.125
<i>And now</i>

01:15:36.375 --> 01:15:43.250
<i>They twinkle in your eyes</i>

01:15:45.375 --> 01:15:50.458
<i>The breeze has fallen silent</i>

01:15:51.333 --> 01:15:56.458
<i>All by itself</i>

01:15:57.375 --> 01:16:02.375
<i>And the flowers have gathered</i>

01:16:03.375 --> 01:16:08.625
<i>To sing you this gentle lullaby</i>

01:16:14.083 --> 01:16:16.208
<i>Those weren't tears of sorrow.</i>

01:16:16.500 --> 01:16:21.208
They were from the despair of not having
her own child to sing lullabies to.

01:16:21.333 --> 01:16:24.083
Did Devika ever lose hope?

01:16:25.833 --> 01:16:28.041
- No.
- I will become a mother.

01:16:31.250 --> 01:16:32.375
I will become a mother.

01:16:43.958 --> 01:16:45.125
In that hope…

01:16:54.333 --> 01:16:56.083
she lost herself.

01:16:57.916 --> 01:16:59.583
<i>Another year passed.</i>

01:17:00.666 --> 01:17:02.750
<i>Another baby was
about to arrive in the family.</i>

01:17:03.208 --> 01:17:04.083
<i>Devika's?</i>

01:17:04.333 --> 01:17:05.375
How are you, Devika?

01:17:06.416 --> 01:17:08.458
<i>No. Ramya was expecting again.</i>

01:17:08.750 --> 01:17:10.250
I heard that Ramya visited.

01:17:11.125 --> 01:17:12.333
Did you see her child?

01:17:13.250 --> 01:17:16.625
He is growing up so fast. He's adorable!

01:17:17.666 --> 01:17:20.041
He looks even cuter
in the sweater you knitted.

01:17:28.583 --> 01:17:29.625
What happened next?

01:17:32.250 --> 01:17:33.208
Next…

01:17:50.583 --> 01:17:52.666
Those who advised her at every step…

01:17:56.916 --> 01:17:58.125
Let me see.

01:18:02.708 --> 01:18:05.583
<i>They began fearing the sound
of those very footsteps.</i>

01:18:15.250 --> 01:18:16.125
What happened?

01:18:17.375 --> 01:18:18.708
You shouldn't have come.

01:18:19.083 --> 01:18:21.375
<i>He looks even cuter
in the sweater you knitted.</i>

01:18:21.916 --> 01:18:24.083
Who did you give it to?
Who do you think it belonged to?

01:18:24.208 --> 01:18:26.708
Not yours. Not mine. It's my child's!

01:18:30.166 --> 01:18:31.750
No matter what you all think…

01:18:33.500 --> 01:18:35.166
<i>Even if fate is against me.</i>

01:18:35.500 --> 01:18:38.208
Even if God Himself doesn't want it,
I will become a mother!

01:18:41.583 --> 01:18:42.541
For our baby.

01:19:08.916 --> 01:19:09.916
Another one?

01:19:12.333 --> 01:19:13.250
Yes.

01:19:30.416 --> 01:19:31.291
Be careful.

01:19:44.208 --> 01:19:45.166
My son!

01:20:24.500 --> 01:20:26.291
Did you come back to your home?

01:20:27.541 --> 01:20:29.208
I want to perform again.

01:20:40.875 --> 01:20:44.041
But I won't play Devaki
the mother who loses her children.

01:20:44.291 --> 01:20:45.833
Without Devaki…

01:20:47.375 --> 01:20:48.958
- there's no eighth child.
<i>- Kamsa!</i>

01:20:50.208 --> 01:20:53.416
<i>Devaki's eighth child will be your death!</i>

01:20:53.583 --> 01:20:56.458
For twenty-five years,
I've dedicated my life to this art.

01:20:58.750 --> 01:21:02.083
<i>Yakshagana</i> is your home.

01:21:12.000 --> 01:21:14.041
I won't die!

01:21:15.416 --> 01:21:17.083
- I won't!
- Stop, Devika!

01:21:17.541 --> 01:21:19.540
I won't die!

01:21:19.541 --> 01:21:21.291
<i>Even if you leave this art form…</i>

01:21:22.833 --> 01:21:24.125
<i>it will never leave you.</i>

01:21:24.541 --> 01:21:28.958
You must die… in my hands!

01:21:30.375 --> 01:21:32.750
You must die!

01:21:45.250 --> 01:21:49.000
I have to become a mother. No matter what.

01:21:52.000 --> 01:21:55.583
The God you've worshipped
all these years has done nothing for you.

01:21:58.666 --> 01:21:59.750
There is a place…

01:22:06.166 --> 01:22:07.500
with a divine power.

01:22:12.041 --> 01:22:13.041
<i>Go there.</i>

01:22:20.041 --> 01:22:23.125
Your wish to become
a mother will come true.

01:22:25.666 --> 01:22:28.540
In return,
the Goddess asks something of you.

01:22:28.541 --> 01:22:30.208
But you cannot do it.

01:22:30.583 --> 01:22:32.874
I don't care!
I just want my wish to come true.

01:22:32.875 --> 01:22:35.333
- Listen carefully, Devika.
- I would give my life if I had to.

01:22:37.458 --> 01:22:41.333
The God you bowed to has now bound you.

01:22:44.166 --> 01:22:47.500
From this moment,
a higher power will guide you.

01:22:47.958 --> 01:22:48.875
Go, Devika.

01:22:49.750 --> 01:22:51.708
<i>The Goddess will grant your wish.</i>

01:23:03.666 --> 01:23:05.666
- Mohan!
- You will be a mother soon.

01:23:20.416 --> 01:23:21.875
- Really?
- Yes.

01:23:30.916 --> 01:23:34.541
There will be celebrations.
Come back after that.

01:24:05.541 --> 01:24:06.958
<i>Remember, Devika!</i>

01:24:08.250 --> 01:24:10.000
Every wish comes with a price.

01:24:13.708 --> 01:24:15.375
<i>It was time to pay that price.</i>

01:24:16.000 --> 01:24:18.416
What are you saying?
How is that possible?

01:24:19.125 --> 01:24:20.958
No. I can't do it!

01:24:27.375 --> 01:24:28.291
Mohan!

01:24:38.666 --> 01:24:39.666
Wait, Devika!

01:24:41.041 --> 01:24:42.083
Remember.

01:24:42.416 --> 01:24:45.750
Whatever the goddess can give,
she can take back!

01:24:50.458 --> 01:24:51.541
What happened?

01:25:24.833 --> 01:25:26.208
Remember, Devika!

01:25:27.583 --> 01:25:29.125
Whatever the goddess can give…

01:25:30.541 --> 01:25:32.625
<i>she can take back!</i>

01:25:33.416 --> 01:25:34.583
I can't do this!

01:26:20.041 --> 01:26:23.041
There is severe damage to the womb.

01:26:23.791 --> 01:26:27.874
- In such cases, the baby won't survive.
- How can you say my baby won't survive?

01:26:27.875 --> 01:26:29.665
How can you say? My baby will be fine!

01:26:29.666 --> 01:26:31.582
- I will protect my baby! You know nothing.
- Devika!

01:26:31.583 --> 01:26:35.333
- Stop, Devika. Listen.
- I cannot become a mother without my baby.

01:26:35.833 --> 01:26:37.290
You don't know anything.

01:26:37.291 --> 01:26:39.375
- Okay.
- How can you say that?

01:26:39.875 --> 01:26:41.166
How…

01:26:43.750 --> 01:26:45.000
how can you say that?

01:26:58.583 --> 01:27:01.166
<i>My baby shouldn't get hurt.
My baby must stay alive.</i>

01:27:01.875 --> 01:27:03.333
It's not too late yet.

01:27:05.666 --> 01:27:07.041
I warned you earlier…

01:27:10.875 --> 01:27:12.416
that you cannot do this.

01:27:14.291 --> 01:27:15.333
Sister!

01:27:16.500 --> 01:27:19.541
Mother-in-law forgot her bangles.
I'll give them to her and be back.

01:27:27.416 --> 01:27:28.750
Everything will be fine, sister.

01:27:35.125 --> 01:27:36.041
<i>Remember!</i>

01:27:37.708 --> 01:27:39.291
<i>Whatever the goddess can give…</i>

01:27:41.000 --> 01:27:42.625
<i>she can take back.</i>

01:27:43.541 --> 01:27:46.791
As I said yesterday, the baby's survival
is impossible in such cases.

01:27:47.500 --> 01:27:48.958
There would be many complications.

01:27:49.541 --> 01:27:53.291
We'll have to operate
and remove the fetus from the womb.

01:27:56.791 --> 01:27:57.791
But…

01:27:58.958 --> 01:28:00.083
What happened, doctor?

01:28:06.833 --> 01:28:08.208
<i>The Goddess is watching.</i>

01:28:15.541 --> 01:28:16.750
<i>She demands a sacrifice.</i>

01:28:22.208 --> 01:28:25.875
- Who's that? Who?
<i>- Six lives with the power to create life…</i>

01:28:26.875 --> 01:28:28.875
<i>The Goddess demands their lives from you.</i>

01:28:29.541 --> 01:28:31.958
- Sister?
<i>- It's not too late yet.</i>

01:28:32.416 --> 01:28:36.583
Everything will be fine, sister.
The Goddess will take care of it.

01:28:36.875 --> 01:28:37.833
Why are you here?

01:28:41.041 --> 01:28:42.708
I can't figure out what happened here.

01:28:43.666 --> 01:28:47.208
Not only is the baby safe, but
it looks like nothing happened at all.

01:28:48.708 --> 01:28:50.125
We did nothing.

01:28:54.541 --> 01:28:57.416
It seems like divine intervention.

01:29:29.583 --> 01:29:31.291
Sister…

01:29:38.250 --> 01:29:39.416
Sister…

01:30:26.000 --> 01:30:28.458
Such a nice girl.

01:30:28.833 --> 01:30:32.583
I sent her to bring
the bangles I forgot, Lakshmi.

01:30:33.208 --> 01:30:36.291
- Sister!
- I don't know what happened to her.

01:30:40.791 --> 01:30:41.916
Lakshmi!

01:31:09.750 --> 01:31:13.250
Sister, I am going to the temple.
Will you come along?

01:31:14.541 --> 01:31:16.416
Oh no, I have so much work to do.

01:31:16.708 --> 01:31:19.166
Don't go alone. Take Jyothi with you.

01:31:30.041 --> 01:31:31.375
- Jyothi!
- Yeah?

01:31:38.625 --> 01:31:41.750
<i>Devika had a simple, beautiful wish.</i>

01:31:43.416 --> 01:31:44.750
<i>And to fulfill it…</i>

01:31:46.666 --> 01:31:48.666
<i>she became everyone's worst nightmare.</i>

01:32:04.375 --> 01:32:07.041
Jyothi! What happened, dear?

01:32:08.916 --> 01:32:11.208
Let me go! Let me go!

01:32:12.166 --> 01:32:13.165
Let go!

01:32:13.166 --> 01:32:16.000
<i>The whole village calls you a murderer.</i>

01:32:16.666 --> 01:32:18.958
<i>How does that make you feel?</i>

01:32:20.666 --> 01:32:23.083
<i>You all call me a murderer.</i>

01:32:23.833 --> 01:32:24.750
<i>But…</i>

01:32:25.416 --> 01:32:27.708
<i>the day my child calls me "Mother" …</i>

01:32:28.583 --> 01:32:30.916
<i>this whole world will fade into silence.</i>

01:32:32.583 --> 01:32:34.125
Did Devika go crazy?

01:32:35.708 --> 01:32:36.625
No.

01:32:37.708 --> 01:32:39.083
Devika was not crazy.

01:32:45.416 --> 01:32:47.958
<i>Treating her taught me
that the most dangerous people…</i>

01:32:48.916 --> 01:32:50.916
<i>aren't the ones who have lost their minds…</i>

01:32:57.875 --> 01:33:00.125
<i>but the ones who have made up their minds.</i>

01:33:02.000 --> 01:33:06.458
<i>After that incident,
women were not allowed near that room.</i>

01:33:06.750 --> 01:33:09.000
{\an8}Ever since Devika was kept in that room,

01:33:09.583 --> 01:33:13.291
<i>she stayed there until her last breath.</i>

01:33:15.791 --> 01:33:18.665
<i>Six lives with the power to create life.</i>

01:33:18.666 --> 01:33:20.666
<i>The Goddess demands as a sacrifice.</i>

01:33:21.125 --> 01:33:23.583
<i>As her baby's life was at risk…</i>

01:33:24.166 --> 01:33:26.208
<i>I will do anything to become a mother!</i>

01:33:26.750 --> 01:33:28.000
I will become a mother.

01:33:29.083 --> 01:33:30.500
I would give my life if I had to!

01:33:33.458 --> 01:33:35.041
<i>In that frenzy…</i>

01:33:36.458 --> 01:33:38.999
<i>- Hey, that girl jumped off!
- Someone go check.</i>

01:33:39.000 --> 01:33:41.708
<i>Devika offered herself
as the third sacrifice.</i>

01:33:44.458 --> 01:33:47.583
No one dared to enter
that room after that.

01:33:48.750 --> 01:33:51.166
No patient was admitted in that room.

01:33:51.958 --> 01:33:53.541
But, three years later…

01:33:54.083 --> 01:33:56.000
They put another girl in that same room.

01:33:56.583 --> 01:33:57.500
Kavya!

01:34:04.708 --> 01:34:07.625
<i>Devika took Kavya as her fourth sacrifice.</i>

01:34:09.708 --> 01:34:11.458
<i>She still needs two more sacrifices.</i>

01:34:12.166 --> 01:34:13.958
<i>She will stay there until she gets them.</i>

01:34:16.125 --> 01:34:17.458
<i>In room 418!</i>

01:34:20.541 --> 01:34:24.291
If a woman sets foot inside that building
now, she won't come out alive.

01:34:26.500 --> 01:34:27.458
What do we do now?

01:34:31.083 --> 01:34:32.541
I'm a man of science.

01:34:32.750 --> 01:34:37.166
My experience has taught me to never
believe anything without questioning it.

01:34:38.500 --> 01:34:39.541
But this…

01:34:43.583 --> 01:34:45.208
is making me question my experience!

01:34:58.958 --> 01:35:01.458
<i>From 12:00 a.m. tonight,</i>

01:35:02.583 --> 01:35:03.916
<i>throughout the country,</i>

01:35:04.708 --> 01:35:08.291
<i>for the safety of you and your family,</i>

01:35:09.416 --> 01:35:11.458
<i>we're going into complete lockdown.</i>

01:35:12.250 --> 01:35:14.250
<i>From 12:00 a.m. tonight,</i>

01:35:15.291 --> 01:35:17.750
{\an8}<i>a total curfew will be imposed.</i>

01:35:22.625 --> 01:35:26.333
Bro! We'll miss our bus
if we don't leave in the next two minutes.

01:35:26.541 --> 01:35:28.916
We should pack the stuff
immediately. Let's go!

01:35:31.875 --> 01:35:34.000
Will you leave me here alone?

01:35:48.750 --> 01:35:49.666
I'm sorry.

01:35:52.833 --> 01:35:56.166
I should've trusted you
when you first told me.

01:36:06.166 --> 01:36:07.832
<i>Hi, Rohith! Remember when I said</i>

01:36:07.833 --> 01:36:11.000
<i>I'll go to that room
before my quarantine ends in two days?</i>

01:36:11.791 --> 01:36:14.041
<i>Did you tell the PM to impose lockdown?</i>

01:36:14.625 --> 01:36:16.875
<i>I'll never be able to go
to that room because of it.</i>

01:36:17.041 --> 01:36:20.250
<i>Remember what I said?
Even the PM can't stop me!</i>

01:36:20.541 --> 01:36:22.583
But… guess what?

01:36:23.916 --> 01:36:26.416
Change of plans. I'm going tonight!

01:36:26.833 --> 01:36:27.750
Rohith!

01:36:28.041 --> 01:36:30.875
I called you so
you can come witness it in person.

01:36:31.500 --> 01:36:33.041
It's okay if you can't, though.

01:36:33.208 --> 01:36:34.541
I have two witnesses with me.

01:36:39.666 --> 01:36:40.666
Okay…

01:36:41.500 --> 01:36:42.750
Looks like perfect timing.

01:36:43.250 --> 01:36:46.290
Like the saying goes,
"If you tell me I can't do something,

01:36:46.291 --> 01:36:48.541
I'll do it twice,
and I'll take pictures of it!"

01:36:51.250 --> 01:36:53.916
Okay. See you in 418. Bye!

01:36:54.208 --> 01:36:55.625
No, no, no, no!

01:36:56.333 --> 01:36:57.416
You must stop her!

01:36:58.083 --> 01:36:59.000
Call her!

01:37:03.708 --> 01:37:04.833
She's not answering.

01:37:07.708 --> 01:37:09.208
Pick up, pick up, pick up!

01:37:10.500 --> 01:37:11.625
She's not answering.

01:37:12.458 --> 01:37:14.458
I must stop her! Come on, Vivek!

01:37:18.583 --> 01:37:22.083
After all this,
I'd understand if you don't want to come.

01:37:22.875 --> 01:37:25.791
But I have to go.
I must stop her from entering the hostel.

01:37:27.208 --> 01:37:28.333
We must stop her!

01:37:30.000 --> 01:37:31.250
We must stop Devika.

01:38:15.500 --> 01:38:17.000
<i>Not just my sacrifice!</i>

01:38:21.041 --> 01:38:24.916
<i>I wouldn't be in this mess if I'd killed
everyone who tried to stop me!</i>

01:38:34.916 --> 01:38:37.332
{\an8}- Hello?
<i>- Get to the Dean’s office right away.</i>

01:38:37.333 --> 01:38:38.707
{\an8}<i>-Now.</i>
- What happened, sir?

01:38:38.708 --> 01:38:41.166
{\an8}<i>-Come quick. I’ll explain.</i>
- Okay, sir.

01:38:47.125 --> 01:38:48.665
- Sir!
- Oh, there you are.

01:38:48.666 --> 01:38:50.333
I'm heading out on an important task.

01:38:50.458 --> 01:38:52.999
Check every room and floor
and lock the gates.

01:38:53.000 --> 01:38:54.416
Don't let anyone stay here.

01:39:07.750 --> 01:39:09.416
You've packed enough. You can leave now.

01:39:14.666 --> 01:39:16.958
- I need to talk to you!
- Hey, leave!

01:39:17.291 --> 01:39:20.000
- What's this during lockdown?
- Devika!

01:39:22.375 --> 01:39:24.458
- How do we stop her?
- How would I know?

01:39:24.791 --> 01:39:26.375
I'm just her teacher.

01:39:28.125 --> 01:39:30.750
Her actions sent shivers
through the whole village!

01:39:32.291 --> 01:39:36.250
Imagine what they'd do…
if they find out who was behind it all.

01:39:37.375 --> 01:39:38.916
You must do something!

01:39:39.583 --> 01:39:42.541
Because…
The one who started it must end it.

01:39:47.583 --> 01:39:49.083
There's a divine power there.

01:39:50.416 --> 01:39:52.833
My baby shouldn't get hurt.
My baby must stay alive.

01:39:53.708 --> 01:39:55.166
It's not too late.

01:39:56.958 --> 01:39:58.541
I warned you all along.

01:40:00.166 --> 01:40:01.291
You can't do this.

01:40:01.958 --> 01:40:03.250
I didn't start this.

01:40:04.083 --> 01:40:05.000
It was fate.

01:40:06.333 --> 01:40:07.750
But there must be a way!

01:40:08.250 --> 01:40:09.541
How do we stop Devika?

01:40:10.541 --> 01:40:14.333
I warned Devika long ago
that she can't do this on her own!

01:40:15.708 --> 01:40:17.583
The one you must stop isn't Devika!

01:40:30.750 --> 01:40:33.291
How do we stop Devika
who's turned into Kamsa?

01:40:33.583 --> 01:40:35.416
Devika is a dedicated actress.

01:40:37.625 --> 01:40:41.750
Once she got into character,
even death couldn't stop her.

01:40:42.041 --> 01:40:46.625
To stop Devika, we must first
bring her out of that character.

01:41:21.750 --> 01:41:23.375
Hey! Hey!

01:41:23.750 --> 01:41:26.041
- What's that? Let me see.
- Just books, sir.

01:41:26.333 --> 01:41:28.083
- They're books, sir.
- Hey! Stop!

01:41:28.291 --> 01:41:29.541
- I told you, sir!
- Let me see!

01:41:29.666 --> 01:41:32.041
- They're just books! Books.
- Stop! Show me!

01:41:34.458 --> 01:41:35.375
Come!

01:41:44.458 --> 01:41:47.958
- Open it!
- Okay! I'll show you! I'll show you!

01:41:48.791 --> 01:41:49.666
Bro…

01:41:55.500 --> 01:41:57.916
Didn't I tell you, sir?
They're just books.

01:41:58.791 --> 01:42:00.791
You just wasted two minutes of my time.

01:42:01.125 --> 01:42:03.166
Shut up! Just pack up and leave!

01:42:03.708 --> 01:42:04.708
We're on lockdown.

01:42:05.000 --> 01:42:07.375
- Okay!
- I must lock all the gates.

01:43:03.833 --> 01:43:05.500
Bro! Just give me two minutes.

01:43:08.041 --> 01:43:09.125
Hey, let's go.

01:43:22.208 --> 01:43:23.208
Doctor bro!

01:43:23.750 --> 01:43:25.666
My balls are in my mouth.

01:43:26.125 --> 01:43:28.583
That girl is so brave. What's your excuse?

01:43:28.875 --> 01:43:31.416
She doesn't have them, bro. I do.

01:43:32.500 --> 01:43:34.000
Hey! Shut up and come.

01:43:36.833 --> 01:43:37.708
Is this it?

01:43:39.666 --> 01:43:40.583
Do your thing.

01:43:47.541 --> 01:43:48.625
Sister!

01:43:49.708 --> 01:43:51.041
We've come this far.

01:43:52.000 --> 01:43:53.125
Let's drop this idea.

01:43:53.666 --> 01:43:56.000
I'll only win the challenge
if I enter this room, Maggie.

01:43:56.750 --> 01:43:59.832
Sister, I'll tell Rohith
that we entered the room.

01:43:59.833 --> 01:44:01.250
Let's head back, sister.

01:44:02.166 --> 01:44:04.583
I don't want to cheat to win. Record it.

01:44:25.083 --> 01:44:26.000
All yours.

01:44:29.458 --> 01:44:30.583
Moment of truth.

01:44:31.375 --> 01:44:32.958
Let's find out what's inside.

01:44:36.250 --> 01:44:38.166
We're about to go inside 418, guys.

01:44:52.208 --> 01:44:53.166
Saisha!

01:45:07.291 --> 01:45:08.166
Rohith!

01:45:10.541 --> 01:45:13.250
- Don't open that door!
- Don't tell me what to do, Rohith!

01:45:13.750 --> 01:45:15.125
You know I don't like it.

01:45:15.708 --> 01:45:18.250
You don't know the consequence
of entering that room, Saisha!

01:45:18.416 --> 01:45:21.166
I know! I'll win this challenge!

01:45:21.750 --> 01:45:23.666
I don't give a fuck about the challenge!

01:45:25.125 --> 01:45:28.125
Okay! You win! I lose.

01:45:29.125 --> 01:45:31.041
- Did you record that?
- Yes, it's recorded.

01:45:31.625 --> 01:45:33.916
He's accepted defeat, sister. Drop this.

01:45:35.416 --> 01:45:36.916
Nothing's more important to me

01:45:38.083 --> 01:45:39.375
than you.

01:45:40.250 --> 01:45:42.332
Your safety
is the only thing that matters.

01:45:42.333 --> 01:45:44.375
Please! Let's go.

01:46:10.708 --> 01:46:12.166
There's something over there!

01:46:32.750 --> 01:46:35.083
- What happened?
- Do you hear that?

01:46:37.041 --> 01:46:38.250
I didn't hear anything.

01:46:39.625 --> 01:46:40.541
Exactly!

01:47:25.625 --> 01:47:28.666
You ran all the way just for this?

01:47:29.041 --> 01:47:30.833
Arjun! Move.

01:47:31.333 --> 01:47:33.166
We need to get out of here.

01:47:34.458 --> 01:47:35.916
Looks like you forgot something.

01:47:37.375 --> 01:47:38.875
- Arjun sir.
- Yeah!

01:47:39.166 --> 01:47:40.958
- Please!
- That's better.

01:47:42.583 --> 01:47:45.416
Hey, Goutham! Take a photo
and send it to the warden.

01:47:45.541 --> 01:47:47.833
I will get them all
rusticated from the college.

01:47:49.083 --> 01:47:51.666
I don't mind being rusticated,
or if you beat me up.

01:47:52.166 --> 01:47:54.416
We must leave!
Then, you can do whatever you want.

01:47:54.750 --> 01:47:55.750
You don't mind?

01:47:56.666 --> 01:47:58.458
Who sought your permission?

01:47:58.833 --> 01:48:00.375
It's my choice.

01:48:00.875 --> 01:48:04.583
I will hit you
whenever and wherever I want.

01:48:05.125 --> 01:48:07.458
Sir, you have no clue
what's going on here.

01:48:09.416 --> 01:48:11.041
At least, let Saisha leave.

01:48:12.625 --> 01:48:14.291
Or none of us will make it out alive.

01:48:25.166 --> 01:48:29.291
She's after Saisha.
She will kill anyone who gets in her way.

01:48:30.916 --> 01:48:32.875
Step aside, Arjun. Please.

01:48:43.583 --> 01:48:45.208
Hey, we almost believed you.

01:48:46.125 --> 01:48:48.083
You are telling us our own stories?

01:48:59.000 --> 01:49:00.541
Hey, dude!

01:49:00.750 --> 01:49:02.625
She is the suitcase girl.

01:49:03.000 --> 01:49:03.916
Right?

01:49:04.291 --> 01:49:05.250
Hey, Rakesh.

01:49:05.666 --> 01:49:07.333
She's already been rusticated.

01:49:07.458 --> 01:49:10.083
She's not our concern.
Send her outside.

01:49:10.250 --> 01:49:12.416
- Okay bro!
- What I want is here.

01:49:17.166 --> 01:49:18.250
Hey, suitcase girl!

01:49:18.958 --> 01:49:21.750
Get out. What business do you have here?

01:49:21.916 --> 01:49:24.249
- Hey. Is she your girlfriend?
- Hey!

01:49:24.250 --> 01:49:26.250
I'm talking to you. Get out of here!

01:49:27.416 --> 01:49:28.374
- Rohith!
- Arjun.

01:49:28.375 --> 01:49:29.250
- Rohith!
- Wow!

01:49:30.250 --> 01:49:33.416
Hey, if we hit here,
the reaction comes from there.

01:49:33.875 --> 01:49:35.458
Look at him, man! Wow!

01:49:36.291 --> 01:49:38.416
Rakesh, look at him.

01:49:40.041 --> 01:49:40.916
Rakesh!

01:49:43.375 --> 01:49:44.250
Rakesh!

01:49:58.791 --> 01:49:59.666
Rakesh!

01:50:05.000 --> 01:50:07.166
Hey, hey! Hey!

01:50:16.583 --> 01:50:18.250
Go that way, there's another exit.

01:50:33.958 --> 01:50:36.291
- Bro! Please! Open it!
- Rohith!

01:50:37.916 --> 01:50:41.040
{\an8}I'm here with Neeraj.
We are about to enter 418, to prove that

01:50:41.041 --> 01:50:44.583
{\an8}there's nothing wrong with the room,
and that we were unnecessarily suspended.

01:51:00.041 --> 01:51:02.791
{\an8}- Are you sure?
- Yes, I'm 100 percent sure.

01:51:25.625 --> 01:51:26.500
Rohith!

01:52:05.500 --> 01:52:07.125
Let's go. There's a staircase here.

01:52:08.958 --> 01:52:10.125
Saisha! Grab my hand!

01:52:11.750 --> 01:52:13.041
You'll get hurt! Careful!

01:52:17.708 --> 01:52:18.958
- Doctor bro!
- What's wrong?

01:52:19.458 --> 01:52:20.416
I'm okay!

01:52:21.458 --> 01:52:23.291
She's coming! Let's go!

01:52:27.875 --> 01:52:29.958
Doctor bro, please! Doctor bro!

01:52:35.833 --> 01:52:39.125
- Hello?
<i>- Sir! A girl entered the hostel.</i>

01:52:39.916 --> 01:52:41.416
<i>Hello? Sir!</i>

01:52:52.458 --> 01:52:53.375
Does it hurt?

01:52:55.833 --> 01:52:56.833
You're injured.

01:53:01.875 --> 01:53:04.666
Doctor! Let's get out of here.

01:53:05.791 --> 01:53:08.833
Leave me here. I think I sprained my leg.

01:53:09.416 --> 01:53:12.000
- You guys get out!
- We are not leaving you behind.

01:53:12.291 --> 01:53:14.416
- Let's all go out together. Let's go.
- Yes.

01:53:14.541 --> 01:53:18.208
If Saisha gets out of here,
we'll all be safe, right?

01:53:20.500 --> 01:53:21.958
Get her out first.

01:53:23.125 --> 01:53:27.166
- Just leave, before anything else happens!
- I will get Doctor out. You guys leave.

01:53:28.291 --> 01:53:29.333
Come on. Let's leave.

01:53:45.500 --> 01:53:46.416
Just a second!

01:53:50.791 --> 01:53:51.750
Saisha!

01:54:01.208 --> 01:54:02.083
Come!

01:54:15.000 --> 01:54:16.916
Hey! Doctor bro! What happened?

01:54:19.375 --> 01:54:20.875
How did this happen, Doctor bro?

01:54:21.708 --> 01:54:24.540
Must've happened
when I slipped in the staircase.

01:54:24.541 --> 01:54:26.416
Doctor bro, you are bleeding badly.

01:54:27.041 --> 01:54:28.375
You are bleeding heavily.

01:54:30.500 --> 01:54:33.791
Hey! Hey! Doctor bro! I'm with you.

01:54:34.250 --> 01:54:37.125
Hey Doctor bro! I'm here!
Nothing will happen to you, bro! Nothing!

01:54:37.916 --> 01:54:38.916
I'm here with you.

01:54:42.875 --> 01:54:46.458
I will go and get first-aid kit for you.
Doctor bro! I will get the first-aid kit!

01:54:47.500 --> 01:54:51.374
I will be back in two minutes, bro.
Just hold tight till then, please!

01:54:51.375 --> 01:54:52.540
Just hold on, please.

01:54:52.541 --> 01:54:55.624
Do you mean your two minutes?
Or actually two minutes?

01:54:55.625 --> 01:54:58.625
I will be back in two minutes,
please hold on tight till then!

01:55:11.666 --> 01:55:13.000
Hey! Go away!

01:55:13.125 --> 01:55:14.833
- Go away! Go away, man!
- Arjun.

01:55:16.208 --> 01:55:17.458
Arjun, what are you doing?

01:55:18.125 --> 01:55:21.333
Hey, you told us that she wants only her!

01:55:22.000 --> 01:55:23.833
- Listen to me. Nothing will happen.
- Don't come closer!

01:55:23.958 --> 01:55:26.250
Listen to me. Let us come up, Arjun.

01:55:26.458 --> 01:55:28.332
No! I won't let her near me!

01:55:28.333 --> 01:55:29.708
Won't let her near me!

01:55:30.666 --> 01:55:34.499
- Arjun, listen to me! Arjun…
- She puts my life at risk!

01:55:34.500 --> 01:55:37.416
- It's alright, listen to me.
- Go away, go away!

01:55:37.625 --> 01:55:38.583
Please, man!

01:55:45.208 --> 01:55:48.125
- She'll kill me! Send her away.
- No, Arjun, listen to me.

01:56:08.541 --> 01:56:09.665
Doctor bro!

01:56:09.666 --> 01:56:11.957
Doctor bro, please get up!

01:56:11.958 --> 01:56:15.208
Get up, Doctor bro! Please, Doctor bro!

01:56:20.166 --> 01:56:22.166
- You leave.
- I won't leave without you!

01:56:23.041 --> 01:56:24.291
Maggie, go away!

01:56:27.916 --> 01:56:29.000
Please stop!

01:56:29.833 --> 01:56:31.125
Arjun, please stop!

01:56:32.916 --> 01:56:35.625
Because of you… They lost their lives!

01:56:43.291 --> 01:56:46.416
I won't let anything
happen to you. I won't!

01:56:49.541 --> 01:56:50.500
Two minutes!

01:56:51.833 --> 01:56:53.583
I'll be back in two minutes, Doctor bro.

01:56:53.916 --> 01:56:55.958
- I will be back in two minutes.
- Maggie!

01:56:57.083 --> 01:56:58.625
Maggie! Maggie!

01:56:59.625 --> 01:57:01.000
Maggie!

01:57:02.250 --> 01:57:03.250
No!

01:57:30.000 --> 01:57:31.708
- Please stop!
- Stop!

01:57:34.125 --> 01:57:36.625
Rohith, stop! Stop!

01:57:41.291 --> 01:57:42.625
Please stop!

01:57:44.625 --> 01:57:45.500
Saisha!

01:58:02.750 --> 01:58:03.666
Rohith!

01:58:36.625 --> 01:58:37.500
Rohith…

01:58:39.041 --> 01:58:40.791
- Saisha…
- Please help me!

01:58:41.958 --> 01:58:42.833
Saisha!

01:59:33.041 --> 01:59:35.500
Rohith? What's happening?

01:59:59.208 --> 02:00:00.750
I've found my sacrifice!

02:00:56.958 --> 02:00:57.833
Stop!

02:00:58.583 --> 02:01:00.457
<i>Oh supreme actress!</i>

02:01:00.458 --> 02:01:02.708
<i>Worshipper of the arts</i>

02:01:06.583 --> 02:01:10.291
<i>Begin to step out of your character</i>

02:01:14.541 --> 02:01:18.624
<i>Oh supreme actress!
Worshipper of the arts</i>

02:01:18.625 --> 02:01:22.291
<i>Begin to step out of your character</i>

02:01:22.416 --> 02:01:26.540
- Bhagavata!
<i>- Oh great goddess of acting!</i>

02:01:26.541 --> 02:01:30.375
<i>Let us sing the closing hymns</i>

02:01:30.583 --> 02:01:34.499
<i>Salutations to the gods</i>

02:01:34.500 --> 02:01:38.250
<i>Who facilitated a peaceful play</i>

02:01:38.666 --> 02:01:42.540
<i>Salutations to the gods</i>

02:01:42.541 --> 02:01:46.291
<i>Who facilitated a peaceful play</i>

02:01:46.625 --> 02:01:50.624
<i>Let us bow at their feet</i>

02:01:50.625 --> 02:01:54.208
<i>And sing the closing hymns</i>

02:01:54.375 --> 02:01:57.499
<i>- Let us bow at their feet</i>
- Rohith!

02:01:57.500 --> 02:02:00.540
<i>- And sing the closing hymns</i>
- We must stop her from entering 418.

02:02:00.541 --> 02:02:02.749
Open the door to room 417!

02:02:02.750 --> 02:02:06.000
<i>And sing the closing hymns</i>

02:02:06.541 --> 02:02:10.791
<i>And sing the closing hymns</i>

02:02:20.333 --> 02:02:23.375
Krishnamurthy! Knowing everything,
why did you do this?

02:02:24.875 --> 02:02:27.750
- What happened, Dr. Patil?
- Don't act innocent.

02:02:28.625 --> 02:02:30.541
You bloody know what I'm talking about!

02:02:32.041 --> 02:02:33.250
Calm down, Patil.

02:02:54.958 --> 02:02:56.083
Is everything done?

02:02:57.333 --> 02:02:58.666
We're safe now, aren't we?

02:03:23.750 --> 02:03:24.625
Rachana?

02:03:27.125 --> 02:03:28.958
It's okay. It's okay.

02:03:39.750 --> 02:03:40.666
Where's Maggie?

02:03:52.583 --> 02:03:53.500
Doctor!

02:04:02.416 --> 02:04:03.500
Two minutes!

02:04:06.958 --> 02:04:08.666
He said he'll be back in two minutes.

02:04:22.500 --> 02:04:25.083
What happened, sir?
Why are you behaving like this?

02:04:26.416 --> 02:04:28.458
How many students are there in the hostel?

02:04:29.083 --> 02:04:30.083
The hostel's full, sir.

02:04:30.291 --> 02:04:31.791
We have total 170 students.

02:04:46.791 --> 02:04:48.458
Something's off here.

02:04:52.375 --> 02:04:53.583
We aren't safe yet.

02:04:55.333 --> 02:04:56.208
What do you mean?

02:04:56.500 --> 02:04:58.291
We need to get them out of here.

02:04:58.750 --> 02:05:00.666
We must get them out of this building!

02:05:02.083 --> 02:05:04.416
- Doctor!
- There's no handle.

02:05:05.666 --> 02:05:09.291
We can't open the door.
We need something to open it.

02:05:18.000 --> 02:05:20.750
- How many students are on the first floor?
- Thirty-four, sir.

02:05:21.958 --> 02:05:24.458
- What about the second and third?
- Thirty-four each, sir.

02:05:55.125 --> 02:05:57.499
{\an8}<i>I'm with Neeraj,
and we are about to go to 418</i>

02:05:57.500 --> 02:05:59.708
{\an8}<i>to prove that
there's nothing wrong with this place.</i>

02:06:02.333 --> 02:06:05.791
- You came with Neeraj?
- No. I don't remember anything.

02:06:07.000 --> 02:06:08.208
I don't remember!

02:06:09.291 --> 02:06:10.708
What are you even doing?

02:06:11.458 --> 02:06:14.083
This is the floor plan from
when this building was a mental asylum.

02:06:16.958 --> 02:06:18.041
{\an8}<i>Come quickly.</i>

02:06:27.583 --> 02:06:29.500
There's no room 413 in this blueprint.

02:06:29.666 --> 02:06:32.790
If each floor has 18 rooms,
there must be 36 students, right?

02:06:32.791 --> 02:06:35.208
No, no sir. It's 17 rooms per floor, sir.

02:06:35.458 --> 02:06:38.458
They skipped the unlucky
number 13 on each floor.

02:06:39.708 --> 02:06:43.041
- We continued the same.
- Did you ever go to the fourth floor?

02:06:43.458 --> 02:06:46.291
But the room assigned to Maggie and I…

02:06:46.833 --> 02:06:47.833
is 413.

02:06:48.875 --> 02:06:53.041
{\an8}You may think there's nothing wrong there,
but my safety matters to me, sir.

02:06:53.166 --> 02:06:54.582
{\an8}- That's why I didn't go there.
<i>- Sure?</i>

02:06:54.583 --> 02:06:57.291
{\an8}<i>Yes, hundred percent sure. Open it.</i>

02:06:57.541 --> 02:06:58.708
Now tell me.

02:06:59.458 --> 02:07:03.416
- How many students on the fourth floor?
- There are 34 students even there, sir.

02:07:05.166 --> 02:07:08.000
If a room on the fourth floor is locked,

02:07:09.708 --> 02:07:12.958
how can there be 34 students
there, like the other floors?

02:07:17.375 --> 02:07:19.458
Do you know the value of one medical seat?

02:07:27.041 --> 02:07:29.458
They’ve renumbered
the rooms on the fourth floor.

02:07:31.000 --> 02:07:32.375
They added room number 13.

02:07:38.083 --> 02:07:40.666
Room 413 is 414…

02:07:41.000 --> 02:07:44.583
Room 414… is 415!

02:07:45.833 --> 02:07:49.958
They locked the store room
in the corner… and called it room 418.

02:07:52.958 --> 02:07:54.166
{\an8}<i>Someone's coming.</i>

02:07:55.083 --> 02:07:56.041
{\an8}<i>Let's hide.</i>

02:07:56.583 --> 02:07:59.041
Room 415 is 416!

02:08:02.041 --> 02:08:04.458
But Devika didn't die there.

02:08:05.875 --> 02:08:09.250
Devika died… in room 418.

02:08:16.375 --> 02:08:19.541
Room 416… is 417.

02:08:26.416 --> 02:08:27.500
And…

02:08:36.208 --> 02:08:38.708
Room 417 is…

02:08:43.750 --> 02:08:45.083
Room 418!

02:10:09.666 --> 02:10:11.000
My stomach…

02:10:31.875 --> 02:10:34.666
- Rohith! Torch!
- I can't find it!

02:10:36.791 --> 02:10:37.833
Careful!

02:10:38.166 --> 02:10:40.625
- Rachana! What happened?
- Rohith!

02:10:40.833 --> 02:10:41.875
Untie Saisha!

02:10:42.000 --> 02:10:43.166
Doctor! Try the door!

02:10:43.375 --> 02:10:45.833
There's no other way out.
Only the window!

02:10:46.166 --> 02:10:47.083
Saisha!

02:10:51.666 --> 02:10:53.083
Saisha! Saisha!

02:10:59.625 --> 02:11:01.041
Saisha! Open the door!

02:11:08.875 --> 02:11:09.916
No, Devika…

02:11:41.458 --> 02:11:43.208
<i>The fifth sacrifice is done!</i>

02:11:46.833 --> 02:11:48.166
Saisha!

02:11:48.916 --> 02:11:50.458
Only one remains now.

02:11:50.708 --> 02:11:51.666
Saisha!

02:11:52.375 --> 02:11:53.250
Saisha!

02:11:56.000 --> 02:11:56.958
Saisha!

02:11:59.291 --> 02:12:00.166
Saisha!

02:12:01.916 --> 02:12:03.541
Saisha! Saisha!

02:12:06.791 --> 02:12:07.791
Devika!

02:12:21.166 --> 02:12:22.041
Mohan!

02:12:23.291 --> 02:12:24.708
Why are you doing this?

02:12:26.500 --> 02:12:29.416
Don't you remember?
You said you didn't want this child!

02:12:31.125 --> 02:12:32.166
It's my child.

02:12:32.333 --> 02:12:34.583
- I'll do anything for my child!
- I remember, Devika!

02:12:36.833 --> 02:12:39.291
But… you have forgotten.

02:12:41.666 --> 02:12:42.958
We had a child.

02:12:52.291 --> 02:12:53.708
You became a mother, Devika!

02:12:53.833 --> 02:12:54.875
Wake up, Devika.

02:12:55.750 --> 02:12:56.750
<i>Look at our child.</i>

02:12:58.208 --> 02:13:00.000
We have a little girl
with eyes just like yours.

02:13:00.833 --> 02:13:04.125
- Open your eyes and look, Devika!
- She isn't in a state to listen.

02:13:04.416 --> 02:13:06.707
There is nothing on her mind
but that one thought.

02:13:06.708 --> 02:13:08.541
- I have to perform my sacrifice!
- Devika!

02:13:08.666 --> 02:13:10.583
- I'll be a mother!
- Listen to me, Devika!

02:13:10.750 --> 02:13:13.207
- I want my baby! Must sacrifice!
- Our baby was born yesterday!

02:13:13.208 --> 02:13:16.083
- I'll be a mother! I must sacrifice!
- What else do you need?

02:13:16.208 --> 02:13:17.708
Please open your eyes, Devika!

02:13:18.500 --> 02:13:21.541
The very child you're doing all this for…

02:13:22.208 --> 02:13:23.333
is the same child…

02:13:25.750 --> 02:13:27.208
you're sacrificing right now!

02:13:28.708 --> 02:13:31.541
- I even thought of baby names, you know?
- If it's a girl?

02:13:33.916 --> 02:13:34.916
Saisha!

02:13:38.125 --> 02:13:39.666
She's your daughter, Devika.

02:13:45.875 --> 02:13:46.916
Your daughter.

02:13:54.791 --> 02:13:59.875
<i>My eyes ache with longing…</i>

02:14:00.791 --> 02:14:06.291
<i>Without getting to see you, my child</i>

02:14:06.708 --> 02:14:12.125
<i>My very soul has longed</i>

02:14:12.750 --> 02:14:17.458
<i>To bring you into this world</i>

02:14:17.833 --> 02:14:21.791
<i>When will you call me "Mother"</i>

02:14:22.916 --> 02:14:27.041
<i>When will you call for me</i>

02:14:27.250 --> 02:14:29.458
<i>My precious child?</i>

02:15:01.625 --> 02:15:02.583
Dad?

02:15:13.583 --> 02:15:15.416
- Saisha…
- Saisha, don't move!

02:15:16.583 --> 02:15:17.500
Careful!

02:15:18.291 --> 02:15:19.166
Careful!

02:15:22.375 --> 02:15:23.625
Stop, Devika!

02:15:24.541 --> 02:15:25.666
Remember!

02:15:30.000 --> 02:15:31.041
I'm here, dear.

02:15:31.583 --> 02:15:33.208
Six sacrifices must be fulfilled.

02:15:33.583 --> 02:15:34.583
Or else…

02:15:35.625 --> 02:15:37.125
- Saisha!
- Saisha!

02:15:37.416 --> 02:15:38.750
- Look out.
- Dear…

02:15:42.166 --> 02:15:45.375
Whatever the goddess can give,
she can take back!

